<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Saraxaraline Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabi Musa Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Saraxaraline</para>
  <para style="mt1">Saraxaraline</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabi Musa Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Tawureta Musa yire saxanden ni i ra. Ala a falama Kitabun yireni ito kui, Isirayila kaane yulubi xafarin sɔtɔma kii naxan yi saraxane xɔn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito fala tide singeni, Ala nan Musa xilima Naralan Bubun kui yire sariɲanxini alogo a xa falan ti a xa. Kitabun yireni ito birin, Ala sariyane nan falama Musa xa lan Isirayila kaane ma, a yi e tuli sa, a naxa, “Naxan na e suxu, na kanna nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn e xɔn.” (Saraxaraline 18.5) A yisoxina, Ala a yɛbama Isirayila kaane xa e lan e xa fe ɲaxin naxanye ba e tagi alogo e nun Ala yi lan. A a yɛba e xa, e lan e xa naxan liga alogo e yire sariɲanxin xa findi e nun Ala naralanden na. Nayi, naxanye saraxan bama, fɔ ne xa a liga nɛn alo sariyana a falaxi kii naxan yi. Saraxaraline lan e xa binya, e yi e yɛtɛ suxu binyeni. Yamanan muxune birin lan e yi fati bɛndɛn fe xɔsixine matanga e nun yulubi feene.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala sariɲanxina, xanuntenyana Ala, na wama a yamaan xa lu a sariɲanni alogo xanuntenyaan xa lu en fan yi. Nanara, a habadan sariyan soxi Isirayila kaane yii, naxan makɛnɛnxi Marigi Yesu xɔn, a naxa, “I adamadi boden xanu alo i yɛtɛna.” (Saraxaraline 19.18, na mɔn sɛbɛxi Matiyu 22.39 kui).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala bata saraxan naxanye birin yɛba Kitabun yireni ito kui, ne en malima nɛn, en yi a famu Marigi Yesu nɔɛ muxune yulubin xafarɛ kii naxan yi. Ala a fala nɛn Nabi Musa xa Kitabun yireni ito kui, a naxa, “N tan bata wunla findi n solona seen na ɛ niine xa, naxan sama saraxa ganden ma. Amasɔtɔ wunla nan n solonama bayo niina a yi.” (Saraxaraline 17.11-12) Na nan findixi Marigi Yesu fan faxa feen na. A tinxi faxan ma nɛn alogo a wunla xa findi Ala solona seen na yamaan xa. Naxan na yulubin liga, na bata findi muxu halagi daxin na Ala yɛɛ ra yi, na lan a xa a niin fi na yulubina fe ra. Na nan a ligaxi, muxune e yiin sama suben xunna ma, e nɛma a bɛ saraxan na. Na bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “Naxan yi lan nun a xa liga n tan yulubi kanna ra, na xa liga subeni ito ra.” Marigi Yesu findixi na saraxa kamalixin nan na yamaan xa. Naxan yi lan nun a xa liga adamadi yulubi kanne ra, na liga Yesu nan na naxan mi yulubi ligaxi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Saraxan naxanye fe sɛbɛxi Kitabun yireni ito kui, ne keden kedenna birin findixi Marigi Yesu a fena nde misaala nan na. En nɔɛ Marigi Yesu a dunuɲa yi gidin bunna kolonɲɛ nɛn en na saraxani itoe bunne fɛsɛfɛsɛ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1"/>
  <para style="s">Sariyane nun Saraxane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1"/>Alatala yi Musa xili Naralan Bubuni, a yi a fala a xa <verse eid="LEV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2"/>a a xa falani ito rali Isirayila kaane ma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 1:2">“Xa ɛ tan nde fama saraxan na Alatala xa, a xa findi ɲingen na hanma yɛxɛɛna hanma siina.”<verse eid="LEV 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3"/>“Xa a ɲingen nan bama saraxa gan daxin na, a xa turaan nan ba fɛ mi naxan na. Na kanna xa fa a ra Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na alogo Alatala xa a rasuxu. <verse eid="LEV 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4"/>A xa a yiin sa saraxa ɲingen xunna ma. Ala a rasuxuma nɛn, a findi a solona seen na na kanna xa. <verse eid="LEV 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5"/>A xa tura bulanna kɔɛ raxaba Alatala yɛtagi. Saraxaraline xa fa a wunla ra, Harunaa diine. Ne yi a so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne ma Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na. <verse eid="LEV 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6"/>Na kanna xa ɲingen budo, a yi a yisɛgɛ dungi dungin na. <verse eid="LEV 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7"/>Saraxarali Harunaa diine xa tɛɛn sa saraxa ganden fari, e yegen sa tɛɛn na. <verse eid="LEV 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8"/>Saraxaraline, Harunaa diine, ne xa a dungine nun a xunna nun a turene sa yegene fari tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9"/>Na kanna xa ɲingen kui seene nun a sanne yixa, saraxaraliin yi e birin sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Saraxa gan daxin na a ra naxan nalima tɛɛn na. A xirin nafan Alatala ma.”<verse eid="LEV 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10"/>“Xa na kanna saraxan findixi yɛxɛɛn nan na hanma siina, a xa kontonna ba fɛ mi naxan na hanma kɔtɔna. <verse eid="LEV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11"/>A xa a kɔɛ raxaba saraxa ganden kɔmɛn fɔxɔni Alatala yɛtagi. Saraxaraline, Harunaa diine, ne xa a wunla so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne ma. <verse eid="LEV 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12"/>Na kanna xa a yisɛgɛ a dungi dungin na. Saraxaraliin xa a dungine nun a xunna nun a turene sa yegene fari tɛɛni, saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13"/>Na kanna xa a kui seene nun a sanne maxa, saraxaraliin yi a birin xali, a e sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Saraxa gan daxin na a ra naxan nalima tɛɛn na. A xirin nafan Alatala ma.”<verse eid="LEV 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14"/>“Xa na kanna saraxan findixi xɔliin nan na naxan bama saraxa gan daxin na Alatala xa, a xa ganban nan ba hanma kolokonde diina. <verse eid="LEV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15"/>Saraxaraliin xa xɔliin xali saraxa ganden fari, a xa a xunna bolonɲɛ a ra, a yi a sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. A yi a wunla rabɔxɔn saraxa ganden dɛxɔnna ma. <verse eid="LEV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16"/>A xa a xɔsɔn ba e nun a yi seene, a yi e woli saraxa ganden dɛxɔn, sogeteden binni, xube bɔxɔndeni. <verse eid="LEV 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17"/>A xa a yibɔ a gabutɛne tagi, hali a mi e ba e bode ra. Saraxaraliin yi a sa yegene fari tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Saraxa gan daxin na a ra naxan nalima tɛɛn na. A xirin nafan Alatala ma.”<verse eid="LEV 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2"/>
  <para style="s">Bogise fi daxine Ala ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1"/>“Xa muxuna nde waxi bogise saraxan fi feni Alatala ma, a xa fa murutu fuɲin nan na. A yi turen sa a yi, a wusulanna sa a fari. <verse eid="LEV 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2"/>A xa a xali saraxaraline fɛma, Harunaa diine. A yi a yiin yɛ keden tongo murutu fuɲini, turen saxi naxan yi e nun wusulanna birin. Saraxaraliin xa na sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari ɲɔxɔ lu seen na Ala xɔn. Bogise saraxan nan na ra naxan nalima tɛɛn na. A xirin nafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="LEV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3"/>Haruna nun a diine nan gbee bogise saraxan dɔnxɛn na. A sariɲan han! Amasɔtɔ a baxi saraxane nan na naxanye ralixi tɛɛn na Alatala ma.”<verse eid="LEV 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4"/>“Xa bogise saraxan na a ra naxan ganxi buru gandeni, a xa findi murutu fuɲi faɲin nan na, a rafala buru xunne ra naxanye bɔnbɔxi turen na hanma buru yilɛnlɛnxine turen saxi naxanye ma. Buru rate seen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.4</char> <char style="fk">burun nate sena:</char> Lɛbɛnna na a ra naxan burun nagboma ayi. </note> nama sa ne yi.”<verse eid="LEV 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5"/>“Xa bogise saraxan na a ra naxan ganxi tunde dutunna ma, a lan a xa findi murutu fuɲi faɲin nan na naxan bɔnbɔxi turen na. Buru rate seen nama sa a yi. <verse eid="LEV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6"/>I xa a yibolon, i turen sa a yi. Bogise saraxan na a ra.”<verse eid="LEV 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7"/>“Xa i ya bogise saraxan gilinxin na a ra, a xa findi murutu fuɲi faɲin nan na naxan bɔnbɔxi turen na.”<verse eid="LEV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8"/>“Bogise saraxan naxan nafalaxi na seene ra, i xa fa na ra Alatala fɛma, i yi a so saraxaraliin yii, a yi a xali saraxa ganden dɛxɔn. <verse eid="LEV 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9"/>A nde bama bogise saraxan na nɛn ɲɔxɔ lu seen na Ala xɔn, a na sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Saraxan na a ra naxan nalima tɛɛn na. A xirin nafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="LEV 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10"/>Haruna nun a diine nan gbee bogise saraxan dɔnxɛn na. A sariɲan han! Amasɔtɔ a baxi saraxane nan na naxanye ralixi tɛɛn na Alatala ma.”<verse eid="LEV 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11"/>“Ɛ bogise saraxan naxanye fima Alatala ma, ne sese nama rafala buru rate seen na. Ɛ nama sese gan buru rate seen na hanma kumin naxan yi xa bogise saraxan na a ra naxan nalima tɛɛn na Alatala ma. <verse eid="LEV 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12"/>Ɛ nɔɛ ne fiyɛ nɛn Alatala ma alo bɔxɔn bogise singene saraxana, koni ɛ nama ne gan saraxa ganden fari alo bogise saraxan naxan xiri rafan Ala ma. <verse eid="LEV 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13"/>I xa fɔxɔn sa i ya bogise saraxane birin yi. I nama ɲinan a sa feen na, amasɔtɔ fɔxɔn findixi Alaa Layirin taxamasenna nan na. A xa sa bogise saraxane birin yi.”<verse eid="LEV 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14"/>“Xa i fa i ya bɔxɔn bogise singene ra Alatala xa bogise saraxan na, i xa se xɔri kɛndɛne nan fi a ma naxanye dinxi, e ganxi. <verse eid="LEV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15"/>I xa turen nun wusulanna sa a fari. Bogise saraxan na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16"/>Saraxaraliin xa nde ba se xɔri dinxine nun turen na, a a sa tɛɛni ɲɔxɔ lu seen na Ala xɔn e nun wusulanna birin. Saraxan na a ra naxan nalima Alatala ma tɛɛn na.”<verse eid="LEV 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3"/>
  <para style="s">Bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1"/>“Xa muxuna nde a ɲingen bama bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na, a xɛmɛna hanma a gilɛna, a xa fa ɲingen na Alatala yɛtagi fɛ mi naxan na. <verse eid="LEV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2"/>A xa a yiin sa ɲingen xunna ma, a yi a kɔɛ raxaba Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na. Saraxaraline, Harunaa diine xa a wunla so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne birin ma. <verse eid="LEV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3"/>A xa a subeni itoe ba a ra, a ne rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na: turen naxanye buru subene ma, e nun naxanye singanxi e ra, <verse eid="LEV 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4"/>a gbingi ra xɛlɛ firinne, e nun turen naxanye e ma a gbingini, farafaran naxan bɔɲɛn ma naxan nun gbingi ra xɛlɛne bama. <verse eid="LEV 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5"/>Harunaa diine xa ne sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari, e nun saraxa gan daxin naxanye yegene fari tɛɛni. Saraxan nan na ra naxan nalima tɛɛn na. A xirin nafan Alatala ma.”<verse eid="LEV 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6"/>“Xa a xuruse xunxurin nan bama bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na Alatala xa, a xa a xɛmɛn hanma a gilɛɛn ba fɛ mi naxan na. <verse eid="LEV 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7"/>Xa a yɛxɛɛn ba, a xa a xali Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8"/>A xa a yiin sa xuruseen xunna ma a yi a kɔɛ raxaba Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na. Harunaa diine xa a wunla so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne birin ma. <verse eid="LEV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9"/>A xa a subeni itoe tongo bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na, a ne rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na: a turena, a xunla nun a turene birin, naxan baxi a gbingi xɔnna ma, a turen naxanye birin a buru subene ma e nun naxanye singanxi e ra, <verse eid="LEV 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10"/>a gbingi ra xɛlɛ firinne, e nun turen naxanye e ma a gbingini, farafaran naxan bɔɲɛn ma naxan bama e nun gbingi ra xɛlɛne. <verse eid="LEV 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11"/>Saraxaraliin ne sama nɛn tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Donseen nan na ra naxan nalixi Alatala ma tɛɛn na.”<verse eid="LEV 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12"/>“Xa a siin nan bama, a xa a xali Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13"/>A xa a yiin sa xuruseen xunna ma a yi a kɔɛ raxaba Naralan Bubun yɛtagi. Harunaa diine xa a wunla so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne ma. <verse eid="LEV 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14"/>A xa a subeni itoe tongo, a ne rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na: a turen birin naxanye a buru subene ma e nun naxanye singanxi e ra, <verse eid="LEV 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15"/>a gbingi ra xɛlɛ firinne, e nun turen naxanye e ma a gbingini, farafaran naxan bɔɲɛn ma naxan bama e nun gbingi ra xɛlɛne. <verse eid="LEV 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16"/>Saraxaraliin xa ne birin sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Donseen na a ra naxan nalima tɛɛn na. A xirin nafan Alatala ma. Alatala nan gbee a turen birin na.”<verse eid="LEV 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17"/>“Habadan sariyan na a ra waxati famatɔne birin yi, ɛ na dɔxɔ dɛdɛ yi: Ɛ nama suben turen don, ɛ nama suben wunla don.”<verse eid="LEV 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yulubi xafari saraxana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Naxan na tantan a yulubin liga, a Alatalaa yamarina nde kala, a xa ito liga: <verse eid="LEV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3"/>Xa saraxaraliin nan yulubin ligaxi naxan masusanxi turen na a findi saraxarali kuntigin na, a yamaan findi yulubi tongon na, a xa fa tura bulanna ra fɛ mi naxan na, a na ba a yulubi xafari saraxan na Alatala xa. <verse eid="LEV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4"/>A xa turaan xali Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na Alatala yɛtagi. A xa a yiin sa turaan xunna fari, a yi turaan kɔɛ raxaba Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5"/>A yi a wunla nde tongo, a a xali Naralan Bubun kui. <verse eid="LEV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6"/>A xa a yii sonla sin wunli, a a xuya Alatala yɛtagi dɔxɔɲa ma solofere yire sariɲanxin yɛ masansan dugin yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7"/>Saraxaraliin xa wunla nde sa wusulan ganden tongonna fenne ma, naxan Alatala yɛtagi Naralan Bubun kui alogo na wunla xa rali Ala ma. A xa turaan wuli dɔnxɛn nabɔxɔn saraxa gan daxin baden san bunna dɛxɔn ma Naralan Bubun dɛɛn fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8"/>A xa turani ito turen birin ba, turen naxanye a buru subene ma hanma naxanye singanxi e ra, <verse eid="LEV 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9"/>a gbingi ra xɛlɛ firinne nun turen naxanye e ma a gbingini, farafaran naxan bɔɲɛn ma naxan bama e nun gbingi ra xɛlɛne. <verse eid="LEV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10"/>A turen bama nɛn alo turen naxanye bama bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxana turani. Saraxaraliin xa e sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11"/>Koni turaan kidin nun a suben nun a xunna nun a sanne nun a kui seene nun a gbiine, <verse eid="LEV 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12"/>e nun a gbindin dɔnxɛn birin, a xa ne xali yamaan daaxaden fari ma xube bɔxɔndeni dɛnaxan sariɲan. A yi e sa yegene fari tɛɛni, a e gan xube malanxin fari.”<verse eid="LEV 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13"/>“Xa Isirayila yamaan birin nan Alatalaa yamarina nde kala tantanni, e mi a kolon, e bata findi yulubi tongone ra na yi. <verse eid="LEV 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14"/>E na a kolon a e bata yulubin liga, yamaan xa fa tura bulanna ra, e na ba yulubi xafari saraxan na. E na xalima nɛn Naralan Bubun yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15"/>Yamaan fonne xa e yiine sa turaan xunna ma Alatala yɛtagi, e turaan kɔɛ raxaba. <verse eid="LEV 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16"/>Saraxarali gbeen xa a wunla nde xali Naralan Bubun kui. <verse eid="LEV 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17"/>A xa a yii sonla sin wunli a a xuya Alatala yɛtagi dɔxɔɲa ma solofere yire sariɲanxin yɛ masansan dugin yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18"/>Saraxaraliin xa a wunla nde sa saraxa ganden tongonna fenne ma, naxan Alatala yɛtagi Naralan Bubun kui. A xa a wuli dɔnxɛn nabɔxɔn saraxa gan daxi baden dɛxɔn ma Naralan Bubun dɛɛn fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19"/>A xa a turene birin ba, a a sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20"/>A xa na turaan liga alo turaan naxan ba a yɛtɛɛn yulubi xafari saraxan na. Saraxaraliin xa Ala solona e xa na kiini, Ala yi e mafelu. <verse eid="LEV 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21"/>A xa turaan xali yamaan daaxaden fari ma, a yi a sa tɛɛni alo a tura singen liga kii naxan yi. Yamaan yulubi xafari saraxan na ra.”<verse eid="LEV 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22"/>“Mangan na yulubin liga tantanni, a Alatalaa yamarin kala, a Ala. A bata findi yulubi tongon na. <verse eid="LEV 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23"/>A na a kolon a a bata yulubin liga, a xa fa kɔtɔn na saraxan na, fɛ mi naxan na. <verse eid="LEV 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24"/>A xa a yiin sa kɔtɔn xunna ma, a yi a kɔɛ raxaba, saraxa gan daxine kɔɛ raxaban dɛnaxan yi Alatala yɛtagi. Yulubi xafari saraxan na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25"/>Saraxaraliin xa a yii sonla sin na wunli, a yi nde sa saraxa gan daxi baden tongonna fenne ma, a yi wuli dɔnxɛn nabɔxɔn saraxa ganden dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="LEV 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26"/>A xa a turen birin sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari, alo bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan turen liga kiinde. Saraxaraliin xa Ala solona mangan yulubina fe ra na kiini, Ala yi a mafelu.”<verse eid="LEV 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27"/>“Xa muxuna nde tantan yamaan yɛ, a yulubin liga, a Alatalaa yamarina nde kala, a bata findi yulubi tongon na. <verse eid="LEV 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28"/>A na a kolon a a bata yulubin liga, a xa fa sii gilɛn na saraxan na fɛ mi naxan na a yulubina fe ra. <verse eid="LEV 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29"/>A xa a yiin sa siin xunna fari naxan bama yulubi xafari saraxan na. A xa a kɔɛ raxaba saraxa gan daxine bama dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30"/>Saraxaraliin xa na wunla nde tongo a yii sonla ra, a yi a sa saraxa gan daxi baden tongonna fenne ma, a yi wuli dɔnxɛn nabɔxɔn saraxa ganden dɛxɔn. <verse eid="LEV 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31"/>A xa a turene birin ba, alo bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan turen ba kii naxan yi. A yi a sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari, a xirin yi rafan Alatala ma. Saraxaraliin xa Ala solona na kiini, Ala yi na kanna mafelu.”<verse eid="LEV 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32"/>“Xa a fa yɛxɛɛ diin nan na a yulubi xafari saraxan na, a lan a xa a gilɛɛn nan ba, fɛ mi naxan na. <verse eid="LEV 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33"/>A xa a yiin sa a xunna fari. A xa a kɔɛ raxaba yulubi xafari saraxan na saraxa gan daxine kɔɛ raxaban dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34"/>Saraxaraliin xa a wunla nde tongo a yii sonla ra, a yi a sa saraxa gan daxin baden tongonna fenne ma, a yi wuli dɔnxɛn nabɔxɔn saraxa ganden dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="LEV 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35"/>A xa a turene birin ba, alo yɛxɛɛn naxan ba bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Saraxaraliin yi a sa saraxan bonne fari naxanye ralima Alatala ma tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Saraxaraliin xa Ala solona na kiini na kanna xa a yulubi ligaxine fe ra, Ala yi a mafelu.”<verse eid="LEV 4:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yulubin misaale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1"/>“Xa yamaan xilixi sereya badeni e yi e rakɔlɔ, xa muxuna nde feen naxan toxi hanma a a kolon, xa a mi sereyaan ba na ma, a bata yulubin liga. A na hakɛn goronna tongoma nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2"/>Xa muxuna nde a din se haramuxina nde ra, xa a findi sube haramuxi faxaxin na, hanma xuruse haramuxina nde, hanma bubuse haramuxina nde, hali a mi a kolon, a fan mi fa sariɲanxi, a bata yulubin tongo. <verse eid="LEV 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3"/>Xa muxuna nde a din se xɔsixina nde ra naxan fataxi adamadiine ra, hali a mi yi a kolon, a na a kolon, a bata findi yulubi tongon na. <verse eid="LEV 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4"/>Xa muxuna nde mi a miri, a a kɔlɔ wulen fari, fa fala a fena nde rabama nɛn. Xa a mi a raba, a bata findi yulubi tongon na.”<verse eid="LEV 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5"/>“Naxan na findi yulubi tongon na na feene yi, na xa a ti a yulubi ligaxin na. <verse eid="LEV 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6"/>Na xanbi ra, a xa fa yɛxɛɛ gilɛn na hanma sii gilɛna, a a ba saraxan na Alatala xa a yanginna ra. Nayi, saraxaraliin xa Ala solona a yulubina fe ra.”<verse eid="LEV 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7"/>“Xa fɛrɛ mi a xa a xuruseen sɔtɔ, a xa fa ganba firin hanma kolokonde firin na, a ne ba saraxan na a yanginna ra Alatala xa, keden yulubi xafarin na, keden saraxa gan daxin na. <verse eid="LEV 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8"/>A xa e xali saraxaraliin fɛma. A xa yulubi xafari saraxan nan singe ba. A xa a kɔɛɛn gira, koni a nama a xunna bolonɲɛ a ra. <verse eid="LEV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9"/>A xa a wunla nde xuya saraxa ganden dɛxɔnna ma, a wuli dɔnxɛn nabɔxɔn saraxa ganden dɛxɔn. Yulubi xafari saraxan na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10"/>A xa xɔliin boden ba saraxa gan daxin na alo sariyana a falaxi kii naxan yi, a yi Ala solona na kanna yulubina fe ra. Ala a mafeluma nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11"/>“Xa fɛrɛ mi a xa a ganba firin hanma kolokonde firin sɔtɔ, a nɔɛ fɛ murutu fuɲin kilo naanin na nɛn yulubi xafari saraxan na. Koni a nama turen hanma wusulanna sa a yi, bayo yulubi xafari saraxan na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12"/>A xa a xali saraxaraliin fɛma, na yi a yiin yɛ keden ba a ra ɲɔxɔ lu seen na Ala xɔn, a yi a sa saraxane fari naxanye ralima Alatala ma tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Yulubi xafari saraxan na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13"/>Saraxaraliin xa Ala solona na kiini na kanna yulubi ligaxine fe ra, Ala yi a mafelu. Saraxaraliin nan gbee saraxan dɔnxɛn na alo a ligan bogise saraxan na kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="LEV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yangin saraxana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15"/>“Xa muxuna nde tinxintareyaan liga, a yulubin liga tantanni a mi Alatala gbee se sariɲanxine fi a ma. A xa fa kontonna ra e nun naxan yɛlan a yanginna ra Alatala xa, fɛ mi naxan na, naxan saren lanxi kala tixin ma, fata yire sariɲanxin gbeti liga seen na. Yangin saraxan nan na ra. <verse eid="LEV 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16"/>A mi se sariɲanxin naxan fixi, a xa a ɲɔxɔn fi, a yi a saren yaganna dɔxɔɲa ma firin sa a fari, a yi a birin so saraxaraliin yii. Saraxaralina Ala solonama nɛn na kanna xa kontonna ra, a naxan bama yangin saraxan na, Ala yi a mafelu.”<verse eid="LEV 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17"/>“Xa muxuna nde yulubin liga, a Alatalaa yamarina nde kala, hali a mi a kolon, a bata findi yulubi tongon na. A a hakɛn goronna tongoma nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18"/>A xa fa kontonna ra saraxaraliin fɛma fɛ mi naxan na yangin saraxan na. A saren xa lan a kala tixin saren ma fata sariyan na saraxaraliin miriyani. Nayi, saraxaralina Ala solonama nɛn a tantanna fe ra, Ala yi a mafelu. <verse eid="LEV 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19"/>Yangin saraxan na a ra, bayo na kanna findixi yulubi tongon nan na Alatala mabinni.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sariyana lan yangin saraxan ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 5:20"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 5:21"/>“Xa muxuna nde yulubin liga, a yi tinxintareyaan liga Alatala ra, a wulen fala a boden xa a yii sena nde a fe ra, naxan taxuxi a ra hanma a a muɲa, hanma a a kansun, <verse eid="LEV 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 5:22"/>hanma a a dɛ yixalan sena nde a fe ra naxan lɔxi ayi, a yi a to, hanma a a kɔlɔ wuleni, hanma a yulubina nde liga alo adaman dari fena, <verse eid="LEV 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 5:23"/>a na na sifan liga, a bata findi yulubi tongon na. A xa na se muɲaxin naxɛtɛ, hanma a naxan kansunxi, hanma naxan yi taxuxi a ra, hanma a seen naxan toxi naxan yi lɔxi ayi, <verse eid="LEV 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 5:24"/>hanma a wulen falaxi seen naxan ma fe ra. A xa na ɲɔxɔn fi, a yi yaganna dɔxɔɲa ma firin sa a fari, a yi a so a kanna yii na lɔxɔn yɛtɛni a na yangin saraxan ba lɔxɔn naxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 5:25"/>A xa fa kontonna ra saraxaraliin fɛma fɛ mi naxan na yangin saraxan na Alatala xa. Na kontonna saren nun kala tixin saren xa lan. <verse eid="LEV 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 5:26"/>Saraxaralina Alatala solonama nɛn, a yi a mafelu na feen na, naxan a findixi yulubi tongon na.”<verse eid="LEV 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6"/>
  <para style="s">Sariyan saraxa gan daxine fe yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2"/>a xa yamarini ito fi Haruna nun a diine ma, a naxa, “Sariyan ni i ra saraxa gan daxine fe ra. Saraxa gan daxin xa lu ganɲɛ saraxa ganden fari kɔɛɛn birin na han xɔtɔnni. Tɛɛn nama tu saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3"/>Na xanbi ra, saraxaraliin xa a maxidi taa dugi gubani e nun a taa dugi bunbirana, a saraxan xuben ba saraxa ganden fari tɛɛn naxanye ganxi, a yi e sa saraxa ganden dɛxɔn. <verse eid="LEV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4"/>Na xanbi ra, a a dugine masara, a xuben xali yamaan daaxaden fari ma yirena nde yi naxan sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5"/>Tɛɛn naxan dɛgɛma saraxa ganden fari, na nama tu. Xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn, saraxaraliin xa yegene fari sa, a yi saraxa gan daxini tɔn tɛɛni, a bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxane turen sa a fari. <verse eid="LEV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6"/>Tɛɛn xa lu dɛgɛ saraxa ganden fari waxatin birin. A nama tu.”<verse eid="LEV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sariyan bogise saraxane fe yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7"/>“Sariyan ni i ra bogise saraxana fe ra: Harunaa diine xa fa a ra Alatala yɛtagi, saraxa ganden yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8"/>Saraxaraliin xa murutu fuɲin nun turen yiin yɛɲayi keden tongo, e nun wusulanna birin naxan saxi bogise saraxan fari. A yi na sa tɛɛni ɲɔxɔ lu seen na Ala xɔn saraxa ganden fari, a xirin yi rafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="LEV 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9"/>Haruna nun a diine xa na bogise saraxan dɔnxɛn don. E xa a don yirena nde yi naxan sariɲan Naralan Bubun sansanna kui. Buru rate se<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.9</char> <char style="fk">burun nate sena:</char> Lɛbɛnna na a ra naxan burun nagboma ayi. </note> nama sa a yi. <verse eid="LEV 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10"/>A mi ganma buru rate seen na. N na nan soxi e yii e gbeen na fata ne saraxane ra naxanye ralima n ma tɛɛn na. A sariɲan han! A sariɲan alo yulubi xafari saraxan nun yangin saraxan sariɲan kii naxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11"/>Haruna bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin daxa e xa a don. E gbeen na a ra fata saraxane ra naxanye ralima Alatala ma tɛɛn na waxati famatɔne birin yi. Naxan yo nɛma a yiin dinɲɛ a ra fɔ a xa sariɲan.”<verse eid="LEV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13"/>“Haruna nun a diine na masusan lɔxɔn naxan yi e yi findi saraxaraline ra, e xa murutu fuɲin kilo saxan ba bogise saraxan na Alatala xa, a tagina xɔtɔnni, a tagiin bonna ɲinbanna ra. <verse eid="LEV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14"/>Murutu fuɲin lan a bɔnbɔ turen na, na yi gan tunde dutunna ma. Na xanbi ra, na burudin xa yigira dungi dungin na, a rali bogise saraxan na naxan xiri rafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="LEV 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15"/>Haruna bɔnsɔnna naxan findima saraxarali kuntigin na, na xa saraxani ito ba. Habadan sariyan na a ra Alatala yɛtagi, a ganma nɛn fefe! <verse eid="LEV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16"/>Saraxaraliin na fa bogise saraxan naxan na, a ganma nɛn fefe, a nama don.”<verse eid="LEV 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yulubi xafari saraxan sariyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18"/>a a xa a fala Haruna nun a diine xa, a naxa, “Sariyan ni i ra yulubi xafari saraxana fe ra. Yulubi xafari saraxan xa faxa Alatala yɛtagi saraxa gan daxin kɔɛ raxaban dɛnaxan yi. A sariɲan han! <verse eid="LEV 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19"/>Saraxaraliin naxan a ralima, na nan a donma. A xa a don Naralan Bubun sansanna kui yirena nde yi naxan sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20"/>Naxan yo nɛma a yiin dinɲɛ a suben na fɔ a xa sariɲan nɛn. Xa a wunla xuya dugina nde ma, i xa na dugin xa yire sariɲanxina nde yi. <verse eid="LEV 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21"/>A na ɲin fɛɲɛn naxan kui, i xa na kala. Koni xa a ɲin sula goronna nan kui, a xa maxa, a malinsaxun. <verse eid="LEV 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22"/>Xɛmɛn naxanye saraxaralina denbayani, ne nan daxa, e a don. A sariɲan han! <verse eid="LEV 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23"/>Koni yulubi xafari saraxan naxan wunla bata xali Naralan Bubun yire sariɲanxin kui Ala solona seen na, na nama don. Na xa sa tɛɛni.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yangin saraxan sariyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1"/>“Sariyan ni i ra yangin saraxana fe ra. A sariɲan han! <verse eid="LEV 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2"/>Yangin saraxan xa faxa saraxa gan daxin kɔɛ raxaban dɛnaxan yi. A wunla yi so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne birin ma. <verse eid="LEV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3"/>A turen birin xa ba saraxan na, a xuli turen nun a turen naxanye a buru subene ma, <verse eid="LEV 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4"/>a gbingi ra xɛlɛ firinne nun turen naxanye e ma a gbingini, farafaran naxan bɔɲɛn ma naxan bama e nun gbingi ra xɛlɛne. <verse eid="LEV 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5"/>Saraxaraliin xa ne rali Alatala ma tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Yangin saraxan na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6"/>Xɛmɛn naxanye saraxaralina denbayani, ne nan daxa, e a don, koni fɔ a xa don yire sariɲanxina nde yi, bayo a sariɲan han! <verse eid="LEV 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7"/>Yangin saraxan nun yulubi xafari saraxan lanxi sariya kedenni ito nan ma: saraxaraliin naxan Ala solonama, a tan nan gbee suben na.”<verse eid="LEV 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8"/>“Saraxaraliin naxan saraxa gan daxin bama muxuna nde xa, a tan nan gbee na kidin na.”<verse eid="LEV 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9"/>“Bogise saraxan naxan birin ganxi buru gandeni, naxan nafalaxi tunde dutunna ma hanma naxan gilinxi, saraxaraliin nan gbee ne ra, naxan saraxan nalixi. <verse eid="LEV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10"/>Bogise saraxan birin naxan basanxi turen na hanma a xarena, Haruna bɔnsɔnne birin nan gbee ne ra.”<verse eid="LEV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan sariyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11"/>“Sariyan ni i ra bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxana fe ra naxan bama Alatala xa. <verse eid="LEV 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12"/>Xa muxuna nde xuruseen bama barika bira seen na, a xa a ba e nun buru xunne buru rate se mi naxanye yi naxanye bɔnbɔxi turen na e nun burudine turen saxi naxanye ma buru rate se mi naxanye yi, e nun buru yilɛnlɛnxin naxanye rafalaxi murutu fuɲin faɲin na naxanye bɔnbɔxi turen na. <verse eid="LEV 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13"/>Buru rate seen buru xunna naxanye yi, na ndee xa sa bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan fari naxan bama barika bira seen na. <verse eid="LEV 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14"/>A xa nde ba ne keden kedenna ra, a na fi Alatala ma. Na findima saraxaraliin nan gbee ra naxan bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan wunla xuyaxi. <verse eid="LEV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15"/>Bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan naxan bama barika bira seen na, na suben xa don a ba lɔxɔn nin. Na sese nama ramara han xɔtɔnni.”<verse eid="LEV 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16"/>“Koni, xa muxuna nde bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan bama alogo a xa a dɛ xuiin nakamali hanma a a ba ɲɛnige ma saraxan na, saraxa suben xa don a ba lɔxɔn nin, koni naxan na lu, a nɔɛ na donɲɛ nɛn na xɔtɔn bode. <verse eid="LEV 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17"/>Saraxan suben dɔnxɛn naxan na lu a xii saxandeni na xa sa tɛɛni. <verse eid="LEV 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18"/>Xa muxuna nde susu a bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan suben don a xii saxande lɔxɔni, saraxan mi rasuxuma. Ala mi a yatɛma sese ra, a ba muxun xa bayo a haramuxi. Naxan na a don, a na hakɛn goronna tongoma nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19"/>Suben naxan na din se haramuxin na, na nama don, a xa sa tɛɛni. Muxun naxan sariɲan, na kanna daxa a saraxa suben don, <verse eid="LEV 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20"/>koni naxan mi sariɲanxi, a yi bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxa subena nde don Alatala gbeen naxan na, na kedima nɛn a yamani. <verse eid="LEV 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21"/>Naxan na a din se haramuxina nde ra, fata adaman na hanma sube haramuxina, hanma xɔsi se haramuxina nde, a yi bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxa suben don Alatala gbeen naxan na, na kanna kedima nɛn a yamani.”<verse eid="LEV 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ nama ɲingen turen don, hanma yɛxɛɛna, hanma siina. <verse eid="LEV 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24"/>I na suben to, a faxaxi hanma burunna subene a yibɔxi, ne turen nɔɛ rawalɛ nɛn se gbɛtɛ ra, koni i nama a don. <verse eid="LEV 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25"/>Naxan na na sube sifane turen don naxanye nɔɛ raliyɛ Alatala ma tɛɛn na, na kedima nɛn a yamani. <verse eid="LEV 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26"/>Ɛ nama xɔliin wunla don hanma suben wunla, ɛ nɛma dɔxi dɛdɛ yi. <verse eid="LEV 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27"/>Naxan na wunla nde don, na kedima nɛn a yamani.”<verse eid="LEV 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Naxan na bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan ba, a xa fa a fɔxɔ kedenna ra, a na ba saraxan na Alatala xa. <verse eid="LEV 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30"/>A yɛtɛɛn xa fa na kiseen na naxan nalima Alatala ma tɛɛn na. A xa fa suben turen nun a kanken na. A xa a kanken yita Alatala ra alo se ralixina. <verse eid="LEV 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31"/>Saraxaraliin xa turen sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari, koni a kanken xa lu Haruna nun a diine xa. <verse eid="LEV 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32"/>I xa bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan yiifari ma danban fi saraxaraliin ma kiseen na. <verse eid="LEV 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33"/>Haruna bɔnsɔnna naxan bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan wunla nun turen nalixi, na nan gbee a yiifari ma danban na. <verse eid="LEV 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34"/>Amasɔtɔ Isirayila kaane bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan naxanye bama, a kanke ralixin nun a danban naxan fixi, n bata ne so Haruna nun a diine yii, saraxaraline. Isirayila kaane na subene nan soma e yii habadan.”<verse eid="LEV 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35"/>“Ito nan findi Haruna nun a diine gbeen na e Alatalaa saraxarali wanla fɔlɔ lɔxɔn naxan yi. A bama ne saraxane ra naxanye ralixi Alatala ma tɛɛn na. <verse eid="LEV 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36"/>Alatala na nan yamarixi Isirayila kaane ma, e to masusan lɔxɔn naxan yi. Habadan sariyan na a ra e yixɛtɛne birin xa. <verse eid="LEV 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37"/>Sariyane nan ne ra saraxani itoe fe ra: saraxa gan daxina, bogise saraxana, yulubi xafari saraxana, yangin saraxana, saraxaraliin dɔxɔ saraxana e nun bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxana. <verse eid="LEV 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38"/>Alatala na sariyan so Musa yii Sinayi geyaan nan fari, a Isirayila kaane yamari lɔxɔn naxan yi Sinayi tonbonni, a e xa fa e saraxane ra Alatala xa.”<verse eid="LEV 7:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxaraline dɔxɔ feen saraxana</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 29.1-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2"/>“Haruna nun a diine xili Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na. I xa fa e dugine nun masusan turen na, e nun turaan naxan bama yulubi xafari saraxan na, e nun konton firin e nun debena buru ratetarene naxan kui. <verse eid="LEV 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3"/>I xa Isirayila yamaan birin malan Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na.” <verse eid="LEV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4"/>Alatala yamarin naxan fi, Musa yi na liga, yamaan yi e malan Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na.<verse eid="LEV 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5"/>Musa yi a fala yamaan xa, a naxa, “Alatala ito nan yamarixi.” <verse eid="LEV 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6"/>Musa yi Haruna nun a diine maso, a yi e maxa. <verse eid="LEV 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7"/>A yi dugin nagodo Haruna ma, a yi a tagi xidi tagixidin na, a gubaan nagodo a ma, a saraxarali domaan nagodo a ma, a saraxarali domaan tagi xidi tagixidi faɲin na. <verse eid="LEV 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8"/>A yi kanke masaan bira a kɔɛ, a masɛnsɛn ti seene, Yurima nun Tumin sa na kui. <verse eid="LEV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9"/>A yi namun so Haruna xun na, a yi xɛma walaxadin sa a tigi yɛɛ ra taxamaseri sariɲanxin na alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="LEV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10"/>Musa yi masusan turen tongo, a Ala batu bubun masusan e nun a yi seen birin. A ne birin nasariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11"/>A yi na turena nde xuya saraxa ganden ma dɔxɔɲa ma solofere, a saraxa ganden masusan e nun a goronne birin, e nun ige sa seen nun a dɔxɔ sena, alogo a xa ne rasariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12"/>A mɔn yi turen sa Haruna xunni, a a masusan, alogo a xa a rasariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13"/>A yi Harunaa diine maso. A yi e dugine ragodo e ma, e nun tagi xidine nun xun tagi xidine, alo Alatala yamarin naxan so Musa yii.<verse eid="LEV 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14"/>A yi fa turaan na yulubi xafari saraxan na, Haruna nun a diine yi e yiine sa turaan xunna fari. <verse eid="LEV 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15"/>Musa yi a kɔɛ raxaba, a a wunla nde tongo, a yi a sa saraxa ganden tongonna fenne ma a yii sonla ra, alogo a xa saraxa ganden nasariɲan. A yi wuli dɔnxɛn nabɔxɔn saraxa ganden dɛxɔn ma. A saraxa ganden nasariɲan na kiini alogo a xa Ala solona mɛnni. <verse eid="LEV 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16"/>Musa mɔn yi turen tongo naxanye yi ɲingen buru subene rabilinni, e nun farafaran naxan yi bɔɲɛn fari, e nun a gbingi ra xɛlɛ firinne nun e turene. A yi na birin sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17"/>Koni a yi ɲingen gbindin nun a kidin nun a suben nun a gbiine woli tɛɛni yamaan daaxaden fari ma, alo Alatala a yamarin Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="LEV 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi fa kontonna ra saraxa gan daxin na. Haruna nun a diine yi e yiine sa a xunna ma. <verse eid="LEV 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19"/>Musa yi a kɔɛ raxaba, a a wunla nde so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne ma. <verse eid="LEV 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20"/>A yi a yixaba dungi dungin na, a a xunna sa tɛɛni, e nun a dungine nun a turena. <verse eid="LEV 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21"/>A yi a buru subene nun a sanne maxa, a yi kontonna gbindin birin sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari saraxa gan daxin na, naxan nalixi Alatala ma tɛɛn na alo a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi. A xirin yi rafan Ala ma.<verse eid="LEV 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi fa kontonna firinden na saraxarali dɔxɔ saraxan na. Haruna nun a diine yi e yiine sa a xunna ma. <verse eid="LEV 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23"/>Musa yi a kɔɛ raxaba, a a wunla nde tongo, a yi a sa Haruna yiifari ma tunla ma. A nde sa a yiifari ma yii konkoribaan nun a san konkoribaan ma. <verse eid="LEV 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24"/>A yi Harunaa diine fan maso, a a wunla nde sa e yiifari ma tunle ma e nun e yiifari ma yii konkoribaan nun san konkoribane. A yi a wunla nde so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne ma. <verse eid="LEV 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25"/>A a turen tongo, e nun a xuli turena, e nun turen naxanye a buru subene rabilinni, e nun farafaran naxan a bɔɲɛn fari, e nun a gbingi ra xɛlɛ firinne nun e turene, e nun a yiifari ma danbana.<verse eid="LEV 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26"/>A deben tongo buru ratetaren naxan kui, naxan yi Alatala yɛtagi. A yi buru xun keden tongo, e nun buru keden naxan nafalaxi turen na e nun burudi keden. A yi e sa suben turene nun yiifari ma danban fari. <verse eid="LEV 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27"/>A yi e birin so Haruna nun a diine yii, a yi e yite Alatala yɛtagi se ralixin na. <verse eid="LEV 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28"/>Na xanbi ra, Musa yi e rasuxu e ra, a yi e sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari saraxa gan daxine fari. Saraxarali dɔxɔ saraxan na a ra, naxan xiri rafan Ala ma. A ralima Alatala ma tɛɛn nan na.<verse eid="LEV 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29"/>Musa yi kontonna kanken tongo a yi a yite Alatala yɛtagi se ralixin na. Na yi findi Musa gbeen na alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="LEV 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30"/>Musa yi masusan turena nde tongo e nun wunla nde naxan yi saraxa ganden fari, a yi a xuya Haruna nun a dugine ma, e nun a diine nun e dugine. Nayi, a yi Haruna nun a dugine rasariɲan, e nun a diine nun e dugine.<verse eid="LEV 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31"/>Musa yi a fala Haruna nun a diine xa, a naxa, “Ɛ suben ɲin Naralan Bubun dɛ ra, ɛ yi a don na, e nun burun naxan deben kui saraxarali dɔxɔ saraxan na, alo n na a yamari kii naxan yi. N naxa, ‘Haruna nun a diine xa a don.’ <verse eid="LEV 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32"/>Ɛ xa burun nun sube dɔnxɛn woli tɛɛni. <verse eid="LEV 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33"/>Ɛ nama keli Naralan Bubun dɛ ra xii solofere, han ɛ dɔxɔ fe lɔxɔne yi ɲan bayo ɛ dɔxɔ feene buma nɛn xii solofere. <verse eid="LEV 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34"/>Alatala to feene yamarixi nɛn alogo a xa solona ɛ xa. <verse eid="LEV 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35"/>Nanara, ɛ xa lu Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na xii solofere, kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na, ɛ yi Alatalaa yamarin suxu, alogo ɛ nama faxa, amasɔtɔ na nan yamarixi n ma.” <verse eid="LEV 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36"/>Alatalaa yamarin naxanye birin fi e ma fata Musa ra, Haruna nun a diine yi ne birin liga.<verse eid="LEV 8:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9"/>
  <para style="s">Haruna nun a diine yi wanla fɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1"/>Xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni, Musa yi Haruna nun a diine xili, e nun Isirayila fonne. <verse eid="LEV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2"/>A yi a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “Turaan dii keden tongo i yulubi xafari saraxan na e nun konton keden saraxa gan daxin na, fɛ mi naxanye ra, i fa e ra Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3"/>I yi a fala Isirayila kaane xa, i naxa, ‘Ɛ xa kɔtɔn tongo yulubi xafari saraxan na, e nun turaan diin nun yɛxɛɛ diina ɲɛɛ keden kedenne, fɛ mi naxanye ra saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="LEV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4"/>e nun turana e nun kontonna bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na, alogo e xa ba saraxan na Alatala yɛtagi, e nun bogise saraxan naxan basanxi turen na. Amasɔtɔ Alatala a nɔrɔn yitama ɛ ra nɛn to.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5"/>Musa naxan yamari, e na xali Naralan Bubun yɛtagi. Yamaan birin yi e maso, e ti Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6"/>Musa yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatalaa yamarin ni i ra ɛ naxan ligama alogo ɛ xa a nɔrɔn to.”<verse eid="LEV 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7"/>Musa yi a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “I maso saraxa ganden na. I yi i yulubi xafari saraxan nun saraxa gan daxin ba, i Ala solona i yɛtɛɛn nun yamaan xa. I xa saraxan ba yamaan fan xa alogo i xa Ala solona e xa, alo Alatala a yamarixi kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8"/>Haruna yi a maso saraxa ganden na, a yi turaan diin kɔɛ raxaba a yɛtɛ yulubi xafari saraxan na. <verse eid="LEV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9"/>A diine yi fa a wunla ra a xɔn, a yi a yii sonla sin wunli, a yi a sa saraxa ganden tongonna fenne ma. A yi wuli dɔnxɛn nabɔxɔn saraxa ganden dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="LEV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10"/>A yi a turen sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari, e nun a gbingi ra xɛlɛne nun farafaran naxan a bɔɲɛn fari, e naxanye baxi yulubi xafari saraxani, alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11"/>Koni a yi a suben nun a kidin sa tɛɛni yamaan daaxaden fari ma. <verse eid="LEV 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12"/>A yi saraxa gan daxin kɔɛ raxaba. A diine yi a wunla so a yii, a yi a so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne ma. <verse eid="LEV 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13"/>E yi saraxan dungi keden keden so a yii e nun a xunna, a yi e sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14"/>A yi a buru subene nun a sanne maxa, a yi e sa saraxa gan daxin fari tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15"/>Na xanbi ra, Haruna yi fa yamana saraxan na. A yi yamana yulubi xafari saraxa kɔtɔn tongo, a yi a kɔɛ raxaba. A na ba yulubi xafari saraxan na alo a singen ba kii naxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16"/>A yi fa saraxa gan daxin na, a na ba alo sariyana a falaxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17"/>A yi fa bogise saraxan na, a yi a yiin yɛ keden ba a ra, a yi na sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari, sa xɔtɔn ma saraxan gan daxin fari. <verse eid="LEV 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18"/>A yi turaan nun kontonna kɔɛ raxaba yamana bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. A diine yi a wunla so a yii, a yi a so saraxa ganden dɛxɔnne ma. <verse eid="LEV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19"/>E yi turaan nun kontonna turen tongo, e nun a xuli turena, a ture yirene, a gbingi ra xɛlɛne, e nun farafaran naxan a bɔɲɛn fari, <verse eid="LEV 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20"/>e yi ne sa subene kankene fari. Haruna yi turene sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. <verse eid="LEV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21"/>Haruna yi subene kankene nun e yiifari ma danbane yite Alatala yɛtagi, se ralixin na alo Musa a yamari kii naxan yi.<verse eid="LEV 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22"/>Haruna yi a yiine yite yamaan binni, a duba e xa. A to yulubi xafari saraxan nun saraxa gan daxin nun bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan ba, a yi godo. <verse eid="LEV 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23"/>Musa nun Haruna yi so Naralan Bubun kui. E to mini, e duba yamaan xa. Alatalaa nɔrɔn yi godo saraxa gandeni yamaan yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24"/>Tɛɛn yi mini Alatala yɛtagi, a saraxan nun turen gan saraxa ganden fari. Yamaan to na to, e sɔnxɔ sɛwani, e yi e xinbi sin, e yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="LEV 9:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10"/>
  <para style="s">Haruna dii firin yi gan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1"/>Haruna dii firinne, Nadaba nun Abihu, ne yi e wusulan gan seene tongo, e tɛɛn sa e kui, e wusulanna sa a fari. E yi fa tɛɛn na Alatala yɛtagi, naxan mi yi lan, a mi yi naxan yamarixi. <verse eid="LEV 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2"/>Nayi, tɛɛn yi mini Alatala yɛtagi, a yi e gan, e faxa Alatala yɛtagi.<verse eid="LEV 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3"/>Musa yi a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “Alatala ɛ rakolonxi nɛn ito ra, a to a fala, a naxa, ‘N na n ma sariɲanna mayitama nɛn n batu muxune tagi. N binyama nɛn yamaan yɛtagi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 10:3">Haruna yi lu dunduxi.<verse eid="LEV 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4"/>Musa yi Mikayeli nun Elisafan xili, Haruna sɔxɔ Yusiyɛli a diine, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xa ɛ ngaxakedenne binbine xali yamaan daaxaden fari ma, keli yire sariɲanxin yɛtagi.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5"/>E yi fa, e yi e xali yamaan daaxaden fari ma, alo Musa e yamari kii naxan yi. Dugine mɔn yi e binbine ma.<verse eid="LEV 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6"/>Musa yi a fala Haruna nun a diine xa, Eleyasari nun Itamara, a naxa, “Ɛ nama ɛ xunna lu a yitɔntaren na, ɛ to sunuxi. Ɛ nama ɛ dugine yibɔ, alogo ɛ nama faxa, ɛ yi Alatalaa xɔlɔn nafa yamaan birin ma. Alatala ɛ kon kaan naxanye faxaxi tɛɛn na, Isirayila yamaan birin nan ne wugama. <verse eid="LEV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7"/>Ɛ nama keli Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na, alogo ɛ nama faxa, amasɔtɔ Alatalaa masusan turen nan ɛ ma.” Musa naxan fala, e na liga.<verse eid="LEV 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8"/>Alatala yi a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9"/>“I na so Naralan Bubun kui, i nama manpaan min, i nama na minse sifan min, i tan nun i ya diine, alogo ɛ nama faxa. A findima habadan sariyan nan na i yixɛtɛne xa waxati famatɔne yi. <verse eid="LEV 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10"/>Ɛ xa se sariɲanxin nun a haramuxin tagi raba, naxan mi daxa e nun naxan daxa. <verse eid="LEV 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11"/>Ɛ xa Isirayila kaane xaran tɔnne ma Alatala naxanye fixi e ma fata Musa ra.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12"/>Musa yi a fala Haruna nun a diine xa naxanye yi fa luxi, Eleyasari nun Itamara, a naxa, “Bogise saraxan naxan luxi, naxan mi ralixi Alatala ma tɛɛn na, ɛ xa na tongo, ɛ yi a don saraxa ganden fɛma. A nama basan buru rate seen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.12</char> <char style="fk">burun nate sena:</char> Lɛbɛnna na a ra naxan burun nagboma ayi. </note> na. A sariɲan fefe! <verse eid="LEV 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13"/>Ɛ xa a don yirena nde yi naxan sariɲan, amasɔtɔ i gbeen na a ra ɛ nun i ya diine, fata na saraxane ra naxanye ralixi Alatala ma tɛɛn na, bayo na nan yamarixi n ma. <verse eid="LEV 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14"/>Koni suben kanken naxan nalixi e nun danban naxan yitexi Ala xa, ɛ nun i ya dii xɛmɛne nun i ya dii tɛmɛne xa ne don yirena nde yi naxan sariɲan. Amasɔtɔ e bata so ɛ yii ɛ gbeen na, naxanye baxi Isirayila kaane bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxane ra. <verse eid="LEV 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15"/>Isirayila kaane lan e xa fa danban na naxan yitexi e nun kanken naxan nalixi Ala ma, sa turene fari naxanye sama tɛɛni, alogo e xa yite Alatala yɛtagi se ralixin na. Habadan sariyan na a ra: I gbeen nan e ra, ɛ nun i ya diine alo Alatala a yamarixi kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16"/>Musa yi kɔtɔna fe maxɔdin, naxan baxi yulubi xafari saraxan na. A yi a mɛ a e bata yi a birin sa tɛɛni. Nayi, a yi xɔlɔ Eleyasari nun Itamara ma, Harunaa dii naxanye lu, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17"/>“Nanfera ɛ mi saraxani ito suben donxi yire sariɲanxini? A sariɲan han! Alatala subeni ito soxi ɛ yii nɛn alogo Isirayila yamana hakɛn xa ba a ma, ɛ yi Alatala solona e xa. <verse eid="LEV 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18"/>Amasɔtɔ subeni ito wunla to mi soxi yire sariɲanxin kui, nayi ɛ lan nɛn ɛ kɔtɔn suben don yire sariɲanxini, alo n na a yamari kii naxan yi.” <verse eid="LEV 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19"/>Haruna yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “I tuli mati. E bata yulubi xafari saraxan nun saraxa gan daxin ba Alatala yɛtagi to lɔxɔni, na kui, i mi a to fe sifan naxan n masɔtɔxi. Na yi Alatala kɛnɛnɲɛ ba, xa n fa yulubi xafari saraxa suben don to?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20"/>Musa to na mɛ, na yi a kɛnɛn.<verse eid="LEV 10:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11"/>
  <para style="s">Sube radaxaxine nun a haramuxine</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 14:3-21">Sariyane 14.3-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, <verse eid="LEV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2"/>a e xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, e naxa, “Bɔxɔn subene birin yɛ, ɛ lan ɛ xa itoe nan don: <verse eid="LEV 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3"/>Sube toro kanna naxanye mɔn donseen laxunma, ɛ nɔɛ ne birin donɲɛ nɛn fɔ naxanye toro mi bɔxi ɲaxi ra.”<verse eid="LEV 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4"/>“Koni ndee na naxanye donseen laxunma tun, hanma naxanye toro bɔxi tun, ne haramuxin na a ra ɛ tan xa. Ɲɔgɔmɛna, na haramuxi bayo a donseen laxunma, koni a toro mi bɔxi ɲaxi ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5"/>Fanyerasiin donseen laxunma, koni a toro mi bɔxi ɲaxi ra. A haramuxin na a ra ɛ tan xa. <verse eid="LEV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6"/>Ɲeren donseen laxunma, koni a toro mi bɔxi ɲaxi ra, a haramuxin na a ra ɛ tan xa. <verse eid="LEV 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7"/>Xɔsɛn toron bɔxi, koni a mi donse laxunma, a haramuxin na a ra ɛ tan xa. <verse eid="LEV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8"/>Ɛ nama e suben don, ɛ nama ɛ yiin din e faxaxin na. E haramuxin na a ra ɛ tan xa.”<verse eid="LEV 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9"/>“Niimaseen naxanye igeni, ɛ lan ɛ xa xali yɛxɛne don naxanye e bama, fɔxɔ igeni hanma baani. <verse eid="LEV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10"/>Koni niimase xunxuri naxanye fɔxɔ igeni hanma baani, e mi e bama, e xali mi e ma, ɛ nama ne don. E xɔsixin na a ra ɛ tan xa. <verse eid="LEV 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11"/>Se xɔsixin nan ne ra ɛ tan xa, ɛ nama e suben don. Ɛ xa e faxaxin yatɛ alo xɔsina. <verse eid="LEV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12"/>Naxanye birin igeni, e mi e bama, e xali mi e ma, se xɔsixin nan ne ra ɛ tan xa.”<verse eid="LEV 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13"/>“Ɛ xa xɔliini itoe yatɛ alo se xɔsixina, ɛ nama ne don: singbinna nun dugan nun xɔlimangan <verse eid="LEV 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14"/>nun bangaan nun sɛgɛn siyaan birin <verse eid="LEV 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15"/>e nun xaxaan siyaan birin <verse eid="LEV 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16"/>nun dangaranfulen nun kutunxunban nun fɔxɔ ige ma xɔliin nun tɔxɛdi tongon siyaan birin, <verse eid="LEV 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17"/>e nun kunkutunna nun ɲinɲaxan nun fɔtɔnbunsamuran <verse eid="LEV 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18"/>nun toxoroon nun yɛxɛ suxu kankon nun kankanna, <verse eid="LEV 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19"/>e nun yaya xɔnla nun saɲi xɔnla siyaan birin, e nun sarasima xɔnla nun tuyɛna.”<verse eid="LEV 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20"/>“Gabutɛɛn nun sanne niimase xunxurin naxanye ma, ba xɔline ra, ne xɔsixin na a ra ɛ tan xa. <verse eid="LEV 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21"/>Koni, xa na niimase xunxurin sifana nde sanna a ligɛ a tugan, ɛ nɔɛ na donɲɛ nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22"/>Ɛ nɔɛ itoe nan donɲɛ ne yɛ: suɲɛn siyaan birin nun xoxorone nun songolonbalane e nun tuguminne. <verse eid="LEV 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23"/>Koni, gabutɛɛn nun sanne niimase xunxuri gbɛtɛ naxanye ma, ɛ xa ne yatɛ se xɔsixine ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24"/>Ne ɛ raxɔsima nɛn. Naxan yo na a yiin din e faxaxin na, na kanna mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25"/>Naxan yo na e faxaxin tongo, na lan a yi a dugine xa. A mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra.”<verse eid="LEV 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26"/>“Suben naxan birin toro mi bɔxi ɲaxi ra hanma a mi donseen laxunma, ne haramuxin na ra ɛ tan xa. Naxan na a yiin din e faxaxin na, na mi fa sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27"/>Sube san naaninna naxanye birin sanna xunduxi, e haramuxin na a ra ɛ tan xa. Naxan yo na a yiin din e faxaxin na, na kanna mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28"/>Naxan yo na e faxaxin tongo, na lan a yi a dugine xa, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. E haramuxin na a ra ɛ tan xa.”<verse eid="LEV 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29"/>“Yili ra seen naxanye bɔxɔn ma, itoe nan haramuxi ɛ tan xa: sulumɛn nun yɛlɛn nun dangen siyaan birin, <verse eid="LEV 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30"/>e nun lɛnnakɔnsaan nun sagadin nun kendemelexaan nun mululuna e nun kolona. <verse eid="LEV 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31"/>Ne nan haramuxi ɛ xa yili ra seene yɛ bɔxɔn ma. Naxan yo na a yiin din e faxaxin na, na kanna mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32"/>E faxaxin na bira se yo ma, na xɔsima nɛn, xa a findi wudi daxin na, hanma dugina, hanma kidina, hanma bɛnbɛnla. Goron yo naxan nawalɛ wali yo yi, a sama nɛn igeni. A mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. Na xanbi ra, a yi sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33"/>Xa na niimasena nde keden bira fɛɲɛna nde kui, a xɔsima nɛn. Ɛ xa na fɛɲɛn kala. <verse eid="LEV 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34"/>Donseen naxan lan a xa don, koni xa na fɛɲɛ kui igen sa a ma, a xɔsima nɛn. Minse yo na min na fɛɲɛn kui, a xɔsixin na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35"/>E faxaxin na bira se yo ma, na xɔsima nɛn. Xa buru ganden na a ra hanma tɛɛ yinla fɔ ɛ xa a kala, bayo a xɔsixi. Ɛ xa a yatɛ alo se haramuxina. <verse eid="LEV 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36"/>Koni xa a faxaxin bira tigini hanma ige ramaradeni, ne mi xɔsixi. Koni naxan na a yiin din a faxaxin na, na mi fa sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37"/>Xa a faxaxin bira sansiin ma naxan lan a si, a mi xɔsixi. <verse eid="LEV 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38"/>Koni xa igen bata sa sansiin ma, a faxaxin yi bira a yi, na sansiin bata haramu ɛ xa.”<verse eid="LEV 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39"/>“Suben naxan lan a xa don, xa na faxa a yɛtɛ ma, naxan na a yiin din a faxaxin na, na mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40"/>Naxan na a suben don, na lan a yi a dugine xa, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. Naxan yo na e faxaxin maxali na lan a xa a dugine xa, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41"/>Ɛ nama niimase xunxuridine don, naxanye bɔxɔn ma. Ne xɔsixin na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42"/>Niimase xunxurin naxanye birin e bubuma bɔxɔn ma, ɛ nama ne sese don. Xa a bubuma a kuiin ma hanma a sigan tima a san naaninne ra hanma a san wuyaxi, a xɔsixin na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43"/>Nayi, ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ raxɔsi na niimase xunxurine xɔn. Ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ raxɔsi e xɔn de! <verse eid="LEV 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44"/>Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala. Ɛ xa ɛ yɛtɛ suxu sariɲanna kui, alogo ɛ xa sariɲan, bayo n tan sariɲan. Ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ raxɔsi niimase xunxuri yo xɔn naxanye e bubun bɔxɔn ma.”<verse eid="LEV 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45"/>“N tan nan Alatala ra naxan ɛ raminixi Misiran yi alogo n xa findi ɛ Ala ra. Nanara, ɛ xa sariɲan, amasɔtɔ n tan sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46"/>Sariyan nan na ra naxan lanxi subene ma, e nun xɔline, e nun niimaseen naxanye birin igeni e nun naxanye bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="LEV 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47"/>Ɛ xa sube haramuxine nun sube daxaxine tagi raba, naxanye lan e don e nun naxanye mi lan e don.”<verse eid="LEV 11:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxanla rasariɲanna diin bari xanbini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Xa ɲaxanla nde fudikan, a dii xɛmɛn bari, a mi fa sariɲanxi na feen ma han xii solofere, alo a nɛma a kike wanli. <verse eid="LEV 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3"/>Xii solomasɛxɛden lɔxɔni, diin yi banxulan. <verse eid="LEV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4"/>A mɔn mi sariɲanxi xii tonge saxan nun saxan benun a xa sariɲan wunla ma naxan minixi a ma dii bari waxatini. A nama a yiin din se sariɲanxi yo ra, a nama siga yire sariɲanxini, han a marasariɲan lɔxɔne yi kamali. <verse eid="LEV 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5"/>Xa a dii tɛmɛn bari, a mi fa sariɲanxi xunsagi firin, alo a nɛma a kike wanli bayo wunla bata mini a ma. A xa a marasariɲanna legeden xii tonge sennin nun sennin. <verse eid="LEV 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6"/>A marasariɲan lɔxɔne na kamali a dii xɛmɛn xa hanma a dii tɛmɛna, a xa yɛxɛɛ diin ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin xali saraxaraliin fɛma Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na, e nun kolokonde diina hanma ganbana, yulubi xafari saraxan na. <verse eid="LEV 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7"/>Saraxaraliin xa na saraxane ba Alatala xa, a yi Ala solona na ɲaxanla xa. A sariɲanma nɛn a wunla ma. Sariyan nan na ra ɲaxanla xa naxan na dii xɛmɛn bari hanma dii tɛmɛna. <verse eid="LEV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8"/>Xa a mi nɔ yɛxɛɛn sɔtɛ, a nɔɛ ganba firin hanma kolokonde dii firin xalɛ nɛn, kedenna xa ba saraxa gan daxin na, bonna yulubi xafari saraxana. Saraxaraliin xa Ala solona a xa, a sariɲanma nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 12:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13"/>
  <para style="s">Furene muxune fatine ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2"/>“Xa muxun fatin yirena nde kusinxi, hanma kafanla a ma hanma fure dɛna nde a fatin ma naxan nɔɛ findɛ fure ɲaxin na dangu muxu gbɛtɛ ma, na xa xali saraxarali Haruna fɛma hanma a diina nde. <verse eid="LEV 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3"/>Furen naxan a fatin ma, saraxaraliin xa na mato. Xa furen yiren xabene bata fixa, a dɛɛn yi tilinɲɛ ayi, fure ɲaxin nan na ra. A na yelin a matoɛ, saraxaraliin xa a fala, a na kanna mi sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4"/>Xa fure dɛ fixɛna a fatin ma, koni a mi tilin, a fati ma xabe mi fixaxi, saraxaraliin xa furemaan lu a danna xunsagi keden. <verse eid="LEV 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5"/>A xii soloferede lɔxɔni, a yi a mato. Xa a to furen dɛɛn mi masaraxi, a mi gboxi ayi a fatin ma, a mɔn xa furemaan lu a danna xunsagi keden. <verse eid="LEV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6"/>Saraxaraliin xa a mato a xunsagi firinden xii soloferede lɔxɔni. Xa furen bata fisa a mi gboxi ayi a fatin ma, saraxaraliin xa a fala, a na kanna bata sariɲan. Kafanla nan tun na a ra. A xa a dugine xa, a sariɲanma nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7"/>Koni saraxaraliin yelin xanbini a falɛ a sariɲanxi, xa kafanla fa gbo ayi a fatin ma, na kanna mɔn xa xɛtɛ saraxaraliin fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8"/>Saraxaraliin mɔn xa a mato. Xa a to kafanla bata gbo ayi a fatin ma, a xa a fala, a na kanna mi sariɲanxi, fure ɲaxin na a ra.”<verse eid="LEV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9"/>“Xa fure ɲaxin bata lu muxuna nde fatin ma, e xa a xali saraxaraliin fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10"/>A xa a mato. Xa kusindena nde a ma naxan dɛ bata fixa, xa na kusinden bata fati ma xaben fixa, a suben minixi kɛnɛnni, <verse eid="LEV 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11"/>nayi fure ɲaxi kɔxɔxin nan na ra. Saraxaraliin xa a fala, a na kanna mi sariɲanxi. A nama lu a danna matoni, bayo a bata a kolon a mi sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12"/>Xa saraxaraliin bata a to a na fure ɲaxin bata gasin namini a fatin birin ma, keli a sanne ma han a xunna, <verse eid="LEV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13"/>a xa a mato ki faɲi, bayo xa na furena a fatin birin ma, a xa a fala furemaan ma, a sariɲan bayo furen bata yelin xarɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14"/>Koni furen dɛɛn na mini a ma lɔxɔn naxan yi, a mi sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15"/>Saraxaraliin na furen dɛɛn to a ma, a xa a fala a ma, a mi sariɲanxi. Fure ɲaxin nan na ra. <verse eid="LEV 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16"/>Xa furen dɛɛn xara, na kanna xa siga saraxaraliin fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17"/>A xa a mato. Xa furen bata xara, saraxaraliin xa a fala furemaan ma, a bata sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18"/>Xa seteen te muxuna nde ma, a yalan, <verse eid="LEV 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19"/>a funfun yi kusin, a fixa hanma a gbeeli, na muxun xa siga saraxaraliin fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20"/>Saraxaraliin xa a mato. Xa furen funfun tilin, a fati ma xabe bata fixa, saraxaraliin xa a fala, a na kanna mi sariɲanxi. Fure ɲaxin na a ra, naxan minixi seteen funfuni. <verse eid="LEV 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21"/>Koni saraxaraliin na a mato, xa a mi fati ma xabe fixɛ to, xa furen funfun mi tilin, a xaraxi, a xa furemaan lu a danna xunsagi keden. <verse eid="LEV 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22"/>Xa furen bata gbo ayi fatin ma, saraxaraliin xa a fala na kanna ma, a mi sariɲanxi. Fure ɲaxina nde na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23"/>Koni xa furen funfun mi masaraxi a mi gboxi ayi, nayi larun nan tun a ra. Saraxaraliin xa a fala na kanna ma a sariɲanxi.”<verse eid="LEV 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24"/>“Xa muxuna nde fatin ganxi, xa furen dɛɛn fixa hanma a gbeeli, <verse eid="LEV 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25"/>saraxaraliin xa a mato. Xa a fati ma xabene fixa, furen dɛɛn tilin, fure ɲaxina nde nan na ra, naxan bata mini ganden ma. Nayi, saraxaraliin xa a fala na kanna ma a mi sariɲanxi bayo fure ɲaxin na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26"/>Koni a na a mato, xa saraxaraliin mi fati ma xabe fixɛ to furen yɛ, a dɛɛn mi tilin, a bata xara, saraxaraliin xa na kanna lu a danna xunsagi keden. <verse eid="LEV 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27"/>Saraxaraliin xa a mato xii soloferede lɔxɔni. Xa furen bata gbo ayi a fatin ma, saraxaraliin xa a fala na kanna ma, a mi sariɲanxi. Fure ɲaxin na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28"/>Koni xa furen mi masaraxi, a mi gboxi ayi, a bata xara, gande funfun nan na ra. Saraxaraliin xa a fala, a na kanna sariɲanxi. Gande larun nan na ra.”<verse eid="LEV 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29"/>“Xa furen lu xɛmɛna nde hanma ɲaxanla nde xunna ma hanma a kenkenna ma, <verse eid="LEV 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30"/>saraxaraliin xa furen mato. Xa a tilin, a xunsɛxɛn hanma a dɛ xaben gbeeli, a xunxurun, saraxaraliin xa a fala na kanna ma, a mi sariɲanxi. Fure ɲaxin na a ra, daxana, naxan a suxi a xunna ma hanma a kenkenna ma. <verse eid="LEV 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31"/>Xa saraxaralina a to furen mi tilin, koni a xunsɛxɛ fɔrɛ munma mini, furemaan xa lu a danna xii solofere. <verse eid="LEV 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32"/>Saraxaraliin xa a furen mato xii soloferede lɔxɔni. Xa daxaan mi gboxi ayi, a mi tilin, a xunsɛxɛn mi gbeeli, <verse eid="LEV 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33"/>na kanna xa a xunna bi, fɔ furen dɛnaxan ma. Saraxaraliin mɔn xa a lu a danna xunsagi keden. <verse eid="LEV 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34"/>Saraxaraliin xa daxaan mato xii soloferede lɔxɔni. Xa a mi gboxi ayi, a mi tilin, saraxaraliin xa a fala na kanna ma, a a sariɲanxi. A xa a dugine xa, a sariɲanma nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35"/>Koni xa daxaan gbo ayi fatin ma, saraxaraliin yelin xanbini a falɛ a a sariɲanxi, <verse eid="LEV 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36"/>saraxaraliin xa a mato. Xa daxaan bata gbo ayi, hali saraxaraliin mi fa a xunsɛxɛn mato, a mi sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37"/>Koni xa a mi gboxi ayi, xa fati ma xabe fɔrɛne bata mini, daxaan bata yalan. A bata sariɲan. Saraxaraliin xa a fala, a sariɲanxi.”<verse eid="LEV 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38"/>“Xɛmɛna hanma ɲaxanla, xa fixɛ fixɛne a fatin ma, <verse eid="LEV 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39"/>saraxaraliin xa a mato. Xa e mi mɔxi, gasin nan tun na ra. A sariɲan.”<verse eid="LEV 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40"/>“Xa muxuna nde xun sɛxɛ mi na, teeli kanna na a ra, a sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41"/>Xa xunsɛxɛ mi a tigi ra, teeli kanna na a ra, a sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42"/>Koni xa furena a teeli hanma a tigi ra naxan fixa hanma a gbeeli, fure ɲaxin nan minixi a ma. <verse eid="LEV 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43"/>Saraxaraliin xa a mato. Xa a kusinden to teeli hanma a tigi ra naxan fixa hanma a gbeeli alo fure ɲaxin kii naxan yi, <verse eid="LEV 13:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44"/>furemaan nan na kanna ra, a mi sariɲanxi. Saraxaraliin xa a fala, a mi sariɲanxi bayo furena a xunna ma.”<verse eid="LEV 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45"/>“Awa, xa fure ɲaxin naxan ma, na kanna xa dugi yibɔxine ragodo a ma, a xunni tɔntaren yi lu, a a dɛɛn yɛ maluxun, a yi gbelegbele. Sariɲantarena! Sariɲantarena! <verse eid="LEV 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46"/>Furen nɛma a ma, a mi sariɲanxi. Nayi, a lan a lu a danna, a xa lu yamaan daaxaden fari ma.”<verse eid="LEV 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dugi funduxine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47"/>“Xa dugina nde bata fundu, xuruse xabe dugina hanma taa dugina, <verse eid="LEV 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48"/>a na findi dugi sɔxɔnxin sifa yo ra hanma xuruse xabe dugine hanma se kidine, <verse eid="LEV 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49"/>xa funduden fɔrɔ hanma a gbeeli dugin ma hanma kidin ma hanma dugi sɔxɔnxin ma hanma se kidina nde ma, funɛ ɲaxin na a ra naxan seen kalama. Saraxaraliin xa a mato. <verse eid="LEV 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50"/>Funɛn seen naxan ma, saraxaraliin xa na ramara matoni xii solofere. <verse eid="LEV 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51"/>Xii soloferede lɔxɔni saraxaraliin xa a mato. Xa funɛn bata gbo ayi na dugin ma hanma dugi sɔxɔnxin ma, hanma se kidin ma, a na rawali kii yo yi, funɛ ɲaxin nan na ra naxan seen kalama, na seen xɔsixi. <verse eid="LEV 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52"/>Nayi, saraxaraliin xa na dugin gan, hanma dugi sɔxɔnxina hanma xuruse xabe dugina hanma se kidina, funɛ funfun naxan ma. Amasɔtɔ funɛ ɲaxin na a ra naxan seen kalama. Na seen xa gan. <verse eid="LEV 13:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53"/>Koni xa saraxaralina a mato, xa funɛn mi gboxi ayi na seen ma, <verse eid="LEV 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54"/>funɛn naxan ma, a xa yamarin fi e ma, a e xa na dugin xa. A mɔn yi a ramara xii solofere. <verse eid="LEV 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55"/>E na a xa, saraxaraliin mɔn xa a mato. Xa a to funɛn mi maxɛtɛxi, a mi gboxi ayi, na seen xɔsixi. Xa funɛn bata dugin suxu a yɛ faɲin ma hanma a yɛ ɲaxin ma, a gan daxin na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56"/>Xa saraxaralina a to funɛn bata ba fɔlɔ, dugin xa xanbini, a xa na funɛ yiren bɔ dugin na, hanma kidina, hanma dugi sɔxɔnxina. <verse eid="LEV 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57"/>Koni, xa a mɔn sa dugi sɔxɔnxin suxu hanma se kidina, funɛn nan na ra naxan seen kalama. Nayi, funɛn seen naxan ma, na xa gan. <verse eid="LEV 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58"/>Funɛn seen naxan suxi, dugina, hanma dugi sɔxɔnxina, hanma se kidina, koni funɛn funfun bata lɔ ayi, na mɔn xa xa alogo a xa sariɲan.”<verse eid="LEV 13:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59"/>Funɛn bata xuruse xabe dugin naxan suxu hanma taa dugina, hanma dugi gbɛtɛ, hanma se kidina, sariyan nan na ra ne fe yi naxan a yitama a e sariɲan hanma e mi sariɲanxi.<verse eid="LEV 13:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14"/>
  <para style="s">Furetɔɔn nasariɲan sariyane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2"/>“Fure ɲaxin muxun naxan ma, na rasariɲanma ikiini: A xa a yita saraxaraliin na. <verse eid="LEV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3"/>Nayi, saraxaraliin xa mini yamaan daaxaden fari ma na kanna matodeni. Xa furemaan bata yiyalan, <verse eid="LEV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4"/>saraxaraliin xa yamarin fi, e xa fa xɔli ɲɛɲɛ radaxaxi firin na, e nun suman wudin nun gari gbeela nun hisopi wudi yiina nde. <verse eid="LEV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5"/>Saraxaraliin xa yamarin fi, a e xa xɔliin keden kɔɛ raxaba fɛɲɛna nde xun ma, tigi igen naxan kui. <verse eid="LEV 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6"/>A xa xɔli ɲɛɲɛn tongo, e nun suman wudin nun gari gbeela nun hisopi wudi yiina, a yi e rafu xɔliin kɔɛ raxabaxin wunli. <verse eid="LEV 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7"/>A yi a xuya na kanna ma sanɲa ma solofere naxan nasariɲanma fure ɲaxin ma. A yi a fala na kanna ma a a bata sariɲan. A yi xɔli ɲɛɲɛn beɲin burunna ra.”<verse eid="LEV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8"/>“Naxan nasariɲanma, na kanna xa a dugine xa, a a fati ma xabene bi, a yi a maxa. Na xanbi ra, a sariɲanma nɛn. Nayi, a nɔɛ soɛ nɛn yamaan daaxadeni, koni a luma nɛn a bubun fari ma xii solofere. <verse eid="LEV 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9"/>Xii soloferede lɔxɔni, a mɔn yi a xunsɛxɛne bi, e nun a dɛ xabene, a yɛ gilingilinna xabene, e nun a fati ma xabene birin. A mɔn yi a dugine xa, a a fatin maxa. Na xanbi ra, a sariɲanma nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10"/>Xii solomasɛxɛdeni, a xa konton firin tongo e nun yɛxɛɛ gilɛna, ɲɛɛ keden kedenne, fɛ mi naxanye ra. A mɔn xa murutu fuɲi faɲin kilo solomanaanin tongo bogise saraxan na turen naxan yi, a turen litiri tagin sa a fari. <verse eid="LEV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11"/>Saraxaraliin naxan na kanna rasariɲanma, na xa e nun a kiseene ti Alatala yɛtagi Naralan Bubun dɛ ra. <verse eid="LEV 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12"/>A xa konton keden tongo, a a ba yangin saraxan na, e nun turen litiri tagi. A xa ne yita Alatala ra saraxa ralixin na. <verse eid="LEV 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13"/>A xa a kontonna kɔɛ raxaba na yire sariɲanxini muxune yulubi xafari saraxane nun saraxa gan daxine kɔɛ raxabama dɛnaxan yi. Saraxaraliin nan gbee yangin saraxan na alo yulubi xafari saraxana. A sariɲan han! <verse eid="LEV 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14"/>Saraxaraliin xa yangin saraxan wunla nde tongo, a yi a sa na kanna yiifari ma tunla ma, e nun a yiifari ma yii konkoribaan nun a yiifari ma san konkoribana. <verse eid="LEV 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15"/>Na xanbi ra, a mɔn xa saraxa turena nde tongo, a yi a sa a yɛtɛɛn kɔmɛn ma yiini. <verse eid="LEV 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16"/>A xa a yiifari ma yii soli keden sin tureni, a yi a xuya Alatala yɛtagi dɔxɔɲa ma solofere. <verse eid="LEV 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17"/>A mɔn yi ndedi sa na kanna yiifari ma tunla ma, e nun a yiifari ma yii konkoribaan nun a yiifari ma san konkoribana. A yangin saraxan wunla saxi dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18"/>Ture dɔnxɛn naxan luxi saraxaraliin yii, a xa na sa na kanna xunni, saraxaraliin yi Alatala solona a xa. <verse eid="LEV 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19"/>Saraxaraliin xa yulubi xafari saraxan ba, a Ala solona na kanna xa naxan nasariɲanma. Na xanbi ra, a yi saraxa gan daxin kɔɛ raxaba. <verse eid="LEV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20"/>A yi saraxa gan daxin nun bogise saraxan nali saraxa ganden fari. A yi Ala solona na kanna xa, a yi sariɲan.”<verse eid="LEV 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21"/>“Xa yiigelitɔɔn nan na kanna ra, a mi nɔɛ saraxane sɔtɛ, a xa konton keden tongo yangin saraxan na, naxan yitama Ala ra solona seen na a xa, e nun murutu fuɲi faɲin bogise saraxan kilo saxan, turen naxan yi, e nun turen litiri tagi, <verse eid="LEV 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22"/>e nun ganba firin hanma kolokonde dii firin, a nɔɛ naxan sɔtɛ. Keden xa findi yulubi xafari saraxan na, bonna saraxa gan daxina. <verse eid="LEV 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23"/>Xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni, a xa fa e ra saraxaraliin fɛma Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na Alatala yɛtagi alogo a xa rasariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24"/>Saraxaraliin xa yangin saraxa yɛxɛɛn nun turen litiri tagin tongo, a yi e yita Alatala ra saraxa ralixin na. <verse eid="LEV 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25"/>A xa yɛxɛɛn kɔɛ raxaba yangin saraxan na. A yi a wunla nde tongo, a a sa na kanna yiifari ma tunla nun a yiifari ma yiin konkoribaan nun a yiifari ma san konkoribaan ma. <verse eid="LEV 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26"/>A yi turena nde sa a yɛtɛɛn kɔmɛn ma yiini. <verse eid="LEV 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27"/>A xa na turena nde xuya Alatala yɛtagi a yiifari ma yii sonla ra sanɲa ma solofere. <verse eid="LEV 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28"/>Turen naxan a yiin kui, a xa na ndedi tongo, a yi a sa na kanna yiifari ma tunla ma, e nun a yiifari ma yii konkoribaan nun a yiifari ma san konkoribana. A bata yi yangin saraxan wunla sa dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29"/>Turen naxan luxi a yiin kui, a xa na sa na kanna xunni, a yi Alatala solona a xa. <verse eid="LEV 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30"/>Saraxaraliin xa ganba keden tongo hanma kolokonde diina, na kanna naxan sɔtɔxi, <verse eid="LEV 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31"/>a yi a ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, a yi xɔliin boden ba saraxa gan daxin na, e nun bogise saraxana. Nayi, a yi Alatala solona na kanna xa.”<verse eid="LEV 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32"/>Sariyan nan na ra na kanna xa, fure ɲaxin naxan fatin ma, naxan mi nɔɛ saraxa kamalixin sɔtɛ.<verse eid="LEV 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Banxi ma funɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34"/>“Ɛ na so Kanan yamanani, n naxan soma ɛ yii ɛ kɛɛn na, xa n funɛn sa banxina nde ma na yamanani, <verse eid="LEV 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35"/>banxi kanna xa sa a fala saraxaraliin xa, a naxa, ‘N bata funɛn to n ma banxin ma.’ <verse eid="LEV 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36"/>Saraxaraliin xa yamarin fi, a e xa seene ramini banxini benun a xa siga funɛn matodeni, alogo sese nama lu banxini a yi yatɛ se xɔsixin na. Na xanbi ra, saraxaraliin xa so banxini a matodeni.”<verse eid="LEV 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37"/>“A xa funɛn mato. Xa funɛn fɔrɔ hanma a gbeeli, xa yilidine banxin ma, <verse eid="LEV 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38"/>saraxaraliin xa mini banxini, a banxin dɛɛn balan xunsagi keden. <verse eid="LEV 14:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39"/>Xii soloferede lɔxɔni, saraxaraliin mɔn xa fa a mato. Xa funɛn bata gbo ayi banxi ma, <verse eid="LEV 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40"/>saraxaraliin xa yamarin fi, a funɛn gɛmɛn naxanye ma, e xa ne ba na, e yi e woli yirena nde yi taan fari ma naxan mi sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41"/>A xa banxin kuiin birin maxɔlin, e yi a lɔxɔn woli ayi yirena nde yi taan fari ma naxan mi sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42"/>Na xanbi ra, e xa gɛmɛ gbɛtɛye tongo. E yi na gɛmɛne masara. E maso se gbɛtɛ tongo, e mɔn yi banxin maso.”<verse eid="LEV 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43"/>“E na a gɛmɛ kalaxine ba na, e banxin maxɔlin, a kankene mɔn yi maso, xa funɛn mɔn mini banxin ma, <verse eid="LEV 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44"/>saraxaraliin xa sa a mato. Xa a to funɛn bata gbo ayi banxini, na nan na ra funɛ ɲaxin na a ra naxan seen kalama. Banxin mi sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45"/>Banxin xa rabira, a gɛmɛne nun a wudine nun a maso bɛndɛne yi maxali taan fari ma yirena nde yi naxan mi sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46"/>Naxan yo na so banxini a balanxi lɔxɔn naxanye yi, na mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna ra. <verse eid="LEV 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47"/>Naxan na a sa hanma a a dɛge na banxini, a xa a dugine xa.”<verse eid="LEV 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48"/>“Xa saraxaralina a mato, funɛn mi gboxi ayi banxin ma a maso xanbini, a xa a fala a banxin bata sariɲan, amasɔtɔ funɛn bata ɲan na.”<verse eid="LEV 14:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49"/>“Na kanna xa xɔli firin tongo e nun suman wudina nde nun gari gbeela nun hisopi wudi yiina nde. <verse eid="LEV 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50"/>A xa xɔliin keden kɔɛ raxaba fɛɲɛna nde xun ma tigi igen naxan kui. <verse eid="LEV 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51"/>A yi suman wudin tongo, e nun hisopi wudi yiin nun gari gbeela e nun xɔli ɲɛɲɛna, a ne sin xɔli kɔɛ raxabaxin wunla nun tigi igeni. A yi a xuya banxin ma sanɲa ma solofere. <verse eid="LEV 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52"/>A yi banxin nasariɲan xɔliin wunla ra, e nun tigi igen nun xɔli ɲɛɲɛn nun suman wudin nun hisopi wudina e nun gari gbeela. <verse eid="LEV 14:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53"/>A xa xɔli ɲɛɲɛn beɲin taan fari ma burunna ra. Nayi, na banxina fe ɲaxin bata ɲan, a yi sariɲan.”<verse eid="LEV 14:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54"/>Sariyane nan ne ra fure ɲaxine fe yi hanma daxana naxanye minin muxun fatin ma, <verse eid="LEV 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55"/>e nun funɛn naxan minin dugin ma hanma banxin ma, <verse eid="LEV 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56"/>kusindene, gasine, e nun larune, <verse eid="LEV 14:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57"/>alogo a xa kolon xa sena nde sariɲan hanma xa a mi sariɲanxi. Sariyan na a ra fure ɲaxin nun funɛ ɲaxina fe yi.<verse eid="LEV 14:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15"/>
  <para style="s">Muxun xɔsima kiinde a bari boden xɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, <verse eid="LEV 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2"/>a e xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, e naxa, “Xa furen xɛmɛna nde bari boden ma, faxunna naxan minima xɔsin nan na ra. <verse eid="LEV 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3"/>Xa a minima hanma a mi tin minɛ, na faxunna bata na kanna xɔsi. <verse eid="LEV 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4"/>Nayi, xɛmɛn na a sa saden naxan ma, na xɔsixi. A na dɔxɔ gbɛdɛn naxan ma, na xɔsixi. <verse eid="LEV 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5"/>Naxan na a yiin din a saden na, na kanna xa a dugine xa, a yi a maxa. A mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6"/>Furemaan bata dɔxɔ gbɛdɛn naxan ma, naxan yo dɔxɔ na ma, na kanna lan a a dugine xa, a yi a maxa, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7"/>Naxan na a yiin din furemaan na, na kanna lan a xa a dugine xa, a yi a maxa. A mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8"/>Xa furemaan dɛ igen namini muxu sariɲanxina nde ma, na kanna lan a a dugine xa, a yi a maxa. A mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9"/>Furemaan na dɔxɔ sese fari a siga sigatini, na mi fa sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10"/>Furemaan bata dɔxɔ sese ma, naxan yo na a yiin din na ra, na kanna mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. Naxan yo na se sifan tongo, na kanna lan a a dugine xa, a yi a maxa, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11"/>Xa furemaan mi a yiin naxa, a na a yiin din muxu yo ra, na kanna lan a a dugine xa, a yi a maxa. A mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12"/>Furemaan na a yiin din fɛɲɛ yo ra, na lan a kala. Xa goronna wudi daxin na a ra, a lan a maxa.”<verse eid="LEV 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13"/>“Furemaan na yiyalan, na kanna lan a legedenna ti xunsagi keden benun a xa rasariɲan. A xa a dugine xa, a yi a maxa tigi igen na. A sariɲanma nɛn na yi. <verse eid="LEV 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14"/>Xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni, a xa ganba firin tongo hanma kolokonde dii firin, a sa e so saraxaraliin yii Alatala yɛtagi Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na. <verse eid="LEV 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15"/>Saraxaraliin xa xɔli keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, bonna saraxa gan daxina. Nayi, a yi na kanna rasariɲan Alatala yɛtagi faxunna ma naxan minixi a ma. <verse eid="LEV 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16"/>Xa xɛmɛn bari bodeni igen mini, na kanna lan a a gbindin birin maxa, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17"/>Xa na ige sifan sa dugin ma hanma se kidin ma, na lan a maxa. A mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18"/>Xa xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla kafu, e firinna birin lan e e maxa, e mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna.”<verse eid="LEV 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19"/>“Xa ɲaxanla a kike wanli, wunla minima a ma, a mi fa sariɲanxi xunsagi keden. Naxan na a yiin din a ra, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20"/>A nɛma a kike wanli, xa a a sa saden ma hanma a dɔxɔ gbɛdɛn ma, na mi fa sariɲanxi. <verse eid="LEV 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21"/>Naxan na a yiin din a saden na, na kanna lan a a dugine xa, a yi a maxa, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22"/>A na dɔxɔ gbɛdɛn naxan ma, naxan na a yiin din na ra, na kanna lan a a dugine xa, a yi a maxa, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23"/>Xa sena nde saxi na saden ma hanma gbɛdɛn ma, a yi dɔxi naxan ma, naxan yo na a yiin din na seen na, a mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24"/>Xa e nun xɛmɛna nde kafu, a wunla yi sa xɛmɛn ma, a fan mi sariɲanxi xunsagi keden. A na a sa sade yo ma na xɔsixi.”<verse eid="LEV 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25"/>“Xa wunla lu minɛ ɲaxanla ma, naxan mi findixi a kike wanla ra, hanma a kike wali waxatin yi xɔnkuya ayi, a mi fa sariɲanxi han wunla yi ɲan alo a nɛma a kike wanli. <verse eid="LEV 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26"/>A na a sa saden naxan ma hanma a dɔxɔ gbɛdɛn naxan ma, na mi sariɲanxi, alo a nɛma a kike wanli. <verse eid="LEV 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27"/>Naxan na a yiin din na saden na hanma a dɔxɔ na gbɛdɛn ma, na kanna lan a a dugine xa, a yi a maxa, a mi sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="LEV 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28"/>Wuli minin na ɲan, na ɲaxanla lan a legedenna ti xunsagi keden, a sariɲanma nɛn na yi. <verse eid="LEV 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29"/>Xii soloferede lɔxɔni, a xa ganba firin hanma kolokonde dii firin tongo, a e xali saraxaraliin fɛma Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na. <verse eid="LEV 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30"/>Saraxaraliin xa xɔliin boden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, bonna saraxa gan daxina. Na xanbi ra, ɲaxanla wuli minin xɔsin ɲanma nɛn Alatala yɛɛ ra yi.”<verse eid="LEV 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31"/>“Ɛ xa Isirayila kaane ratanga na feene ma naxanye e xɔsima, alogo e nama n batu bubun naxɔsi naxan e tagi, e yi faxa e xɔsina fe ra.”<verse eid="LEV 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32"/>Sariyane nan ne ra feni itoe ma: faxunna na mini xɛmɛn bari boden ma, igen na mini xɛmɛn xɛmɛyani a yi a xɔsi, <verse eid="LEV 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33"/>ɲaxanla nɛma a kike wanli, igena nde na mini xɛmɛn hanma ɲaxanla bari bodeni, e nun xɛmɛn naxan kafuma ɲaxanla ma a kike wali waxatini.<verse eid="LEV 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16"/>
  <para style="s">Ala solona lɔxɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1"/>Harunaa dii firinna naxanye siga Alatala yɛtagi, ne faxa xanbini, Alatala yi falan ti Musa xa. <verse eid="LEV 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “A fala i tada Haruna xa, a a nama so yire sariɲanxi fisamantenni yɛ yo yɛ, yɛ masansan dugin xanbi ra Layiri Kankiraan yɛtagi, Ala solonama dɛnaxan yi. Xa a na liga, n minima a ma nɛn kundaan yiyani Layiri Kankiraan dɛraganla xun ma, a yi faxa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fk">16.2</char> <char style="fk">Layiri Kankirana</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 25.10-22 kui.</note><verse eid="LEV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3"/>“Haruna xa feni itoe nan liga alogo a xa so yire sariɲanxi fisamantenni: A lan a tura bulanna ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, e nun kontonna saraxa gan daxin na. <verse eid="LEV 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4"/>A lan a yi taa dugi guba sariɲanxin nagodo a ma, a yi a taa dugi wantanna so. A xa a tagi xidi taa dugi tagixidin na, a yi taa dugi namun so. Na dugine sariɲan, nanara a lan a yi a maxa benun a xa e so. <verse eid="LEV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5"/>Isirayila yamaan lan e kɔtɔ firin so a yii yulubi xafari saraxan na, e nun konton keden saraxa gan daxin na. <verse eid="LEV 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6"/>Haruna xa turaan ba a yɛtɛna yulubi xafari saraxan na alogo a xa Ala solona a yɛtɛ xa e nun a denbayana. <verse eid="LEV 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi kɔtɔ firinne xali Alatala yɛtagi, Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na. <verse eid="LEV 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8"/>A xa kɔtɔne masɛnsɛn alogo a xa a kolon naxan lan a findi Alatala gbeen na e nun naxan sigan yire ɲaxini. <verse eid="LEV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9"/>Masɛnsɛnna na kɔtɔn naxan suxu Alatala gbeen na, Haruna xa fa na ra, a a ba yulubi xafari saraxan na. <verse eid="LEV 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10"/>Masɛnsɛnna na kɔtɔn naxan suxu yire ɲaxin gbeen na, a ɲɛɲɛn nan nalima Alatala ma a solona seen na, e sa a beɲin yire ɲaxini burunna ra. <verse eid="LEV 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11"/>Haruna xa fa turaan na, a a ba a yɛtɛna yulubi xafari saraxan na, a Ala solona a yɛtɛ xa e nun a denbayana. A xa na turaan kɔɛ raxaba a yɛtɛna yulubi xafari saraxan na. <verse eid="LEV 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12"/>A xa tɛɛ kɔ seen nafe tɛɛ wolonna ra naxan tongoxi saraxa ganden fari Alatala yɛtagi. A yi wusulan fuɲin yiin yɛ firin tongo, a yi e xali yɛ masansan dugin xanbi ra, yire sariɲanxi fisamantenni. <verse eid="LEV 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13"/>A xa wusulanna sa tɛɛn na Alatala yɛtagi, alogo tutin naxan tema, na xa Layiri Kankiraan dɛraganla luxun alogo a nama faxa. <verse eid="LEV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14"/>A xa turaan wunla nde tongo a yii sonla ra, a yi a xuya Layiri Kankiraan dɛraganla yɛtagin ma. A mɔn yi a xuya Layiri Kankiraan yɛtagi dɔxɔɲa ma solofere. <verse eid="LEV 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15"/>Na xanbi ra, a xa kɔtɔn kɔɛ raxaba yamaan yulubi xafari saraxan na, a yi a wunla xali yɛ masansan dugin xanbi ra, a yi a liga alo turaan wunla, a a xuya Layiri Kankiraan ma e nun a yɛtagi.”<verse eid="LEV 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16"/>“Na kiini, a xa Ala solona yire sariɲanxi fisamantenna xa alogo a xa rasariɲan Isirayila kaane xɔsi feene nun e murutɛ feene nun e yulubine birin ma. A mɔn xa a liga na kiini Naralan Bubun xa, naxan tixi Isirayila kaa xɔsixine tagi. <verse eid="LEV 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17"/>Muxu yo nama lu Naralan Bubun kui a na so Ala solonadeni yire sariɲanxi fisamantenni, han a yi mini. A xa Ala solona a yɛtɛɛn xa e nun a denbayaan nun Isirayila yamaan birin.”<verse eid="LEV 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18"/>“Na xanbi ra, a yi mini, siga saraxa ganden yireni dɛnaxan Alatala yɛtagi. A yi na fan nasariɲan, a turaan nun kɔtɔn wunla sa saraxa ganden tongonna fenne birin ma. <verse eid="LEV 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19"/>A xa wunla xuya a yii sonla ra dɔxɔ solofere saraxa ganden ma, alogo a xa a rasariɲan Isirayila kaane xɔsine ma.”<verse eid="LEV 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20"/>“Haruna na yelin xɔsine bɛ yire sariɲanxi fisamantenna ma, e nun Naralan Bubuna, e nun saraxa gandena, a xa kɔtɔ ɲɛɲɛn fan maso. <verse eid="LEV 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21"/>Haruna xa a yii firinne sa kɔtɔ ɲɛɲɛn xunna fari, a yi Isirayila kaane hakɛne nun murutɛ feene nun yulubine birin fala a ma, a yi e sa kɔtɔn xunna fari. A yi muxuna nde xɛ, alogo a xa sa kɔtɔn beɲin burunna ra, <verse eid="LEV 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22"/>a yi e hakɛne birin xali wulani. A xa kɔtɔn kedi, a siga burunna ra.”<verse eid="LEV 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23"/>“Na xanbi ra, Haruna xa so Naralan Bubun kui, a yi taa dugine ba a ma, a naxanye so benun a xa so yire sariɲanxini. A xa ne lu na. <verse eid="LEV 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24"/>A xa a maxa yire sariɲanxina nde yi, a yi a dugin bonne ragodo a ma. Na xanbi ra, a xa sa saraxa gan daxi firinna bonne ba a yɛtɛ xa e nun yamaan xa, a Ala solona a yɛtɛ xa e nun yamaan xa. <verse eid="LEV 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25"/>A mɔn xa yulubi xafari saraxan turene sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari.”<verse eid="LEV 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26"/>“Naxan kɔtɔn beɲinxi yire ɲaxini, na lan a yi a dugine xa, a yi a maxa, a fa fa yamaan daaxadeni. <verse eid="LEV 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27"/>Turaan nun kɔtɔn naxanye baxi yulubi xafari saraxan na, naxanye wuli rawalixi yire sariɲanxini Ala solona seen na, ne lan e xali yamaan daaxaden fari ma, e kidine nun e suben nun e gbiine yi sa tɛɛni. <verse eid="LEV 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28"/>Naxan na e gan, na lan a yi a dugine xa, a yi a maxa. Na xanbi ra, a yi so yamaan daaxadeni.”<verse eid="LEV 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29"/>“Habadan sariyan na a ra ɛ xa. Kike solofereden xii fuden lɔxɔni, ɛ xa sunna suxu, ɛ tan Isirayila kaane ba, xɔɲɛn naxanye dɔxi ɛ konni ba, ɛ xa wanla birin beɲin. <verse eid="LEV 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala solonama ɛ xa na lɔxɔn nin, alogo ɛ xa sariɲan. Nayi, ɛ sariɲanma nɛn ɛ yulubine birin ma Alatala yɛɛ ra yi. <verse eid="LEV 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31"/>A xa findi Matabu Lɔxɔn nun sanla ra. Ɛ xa sunna suxu na lɔxɔni. Habadan sariyan na a ra.”<verse eid="LEV 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32"/>“Saraxaraliin naxan bata masusan a sugandi feen na, a dɔxɔ saraxaraliyani a baba funfuni, na nan Ala solonama. A tan nan taa dugi doma rasariɲanxine soma, <verse eid="LEV 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33"/>a Ala solona yire sariɲanxin nun Naralan Bubun nun saraxa ganden nun saraxaraline nun Isirayila yamaan birin xa. <verse eid="LEV 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34"/>Habadan sariyan na a ra ɛ xa. Ala solonama Isirayila kaane yulubine birin ma fe ra lɔxɔ kedenni ɲɛɛn bun ma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">E yi a liga alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="LEV 16:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane xa sariɲan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2"/>a a xa a fala Haruna xa, e nun a diine nun Isirayila kaane birin, a naxa, “Alatala ito nan yamarixi. <verse eid="LEV 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3"/>Isirayila kaan naxan na a ɲingen ba saraxan na, hanma yɛxɛɛna hanma siina, yamaan daaxadeni hanma a fari ma, <verse eid="LEV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4"/>a mi a xali Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na alogo a xa a rali Alatala ma kiseen na Alatala Batu Bubun yɛtagi, na kanna yatɛma nɛn alo faxa tiina. A bata wunla ramini, na kanna kedima nɛn a yamani. <verse eid="LEV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5"/>Na ma, Isirayila kaane bama nɛn saraxan bɛ burunna ra, e fa e saraxane ra saraxaraliin fɛma Alatala yɛtagi Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na, a yi e ba bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na Alatala xa. <verse eid="LEV 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6"/>Saraxaraliin xa a wunla xuya Alatalaa saraxa ganden dɛxɔnna ma Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na, a yi a turene sa tɛɛni, a xirin yi rafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="LEV 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7"/>Nayi, Isirayila kaane nama fa suxure kɔtɔne ki, e tinxintareyaan liga Ala ra naxanye xɔn. Habadan sariyan na a ra e tan xa e nun e yixɛtɛne birin.”<verse eid="LEV 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8"/>A mɔn xa a fala, a naxa, “Isirayila kaan hanma xɔɲɛn naxan dɔxi e tagi, a na saraxa gan daxin ba hanma saraxa gbɛtɛ, <verse eid="LEV 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9"/>xa a mi a xali Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na alogo a xa ba Alatala xa, a kedima nɛn a yamaan yɛ.”<verse eid="LEV 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wunla nama don</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10"/>“Isirayila kaan hanma xɔɲɛn naxan dɔxi e tagi, naxan na wunla don, n kelima nɛn na kanna xili ma, n yi a kedi a yamaan yɛ. <verse eid="LEV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11"/>Amasɔtɔ fati bɛndɛn niina a wunla nin. N tan bata wunla findi n solona seen na ɛ niine xa, naxan sama saraxa ganden fari. Amasɔtɔ wunla nan n solonama bayo niina a yi. <verse eid="LEV 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12"/>Nanara, n na falama ɛ tan Isirayila kaane xa, ɛ tan sese nama wunla don. Xɔɲɛ yo naxan dɔxi ɛ tagi, e nama wunla don. <verse eid="LEV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13"/>Isirayila kaan hanma xɔɲɛn naxan ɛ tagi, naxan na suben hanma xɔliin faxa donsoyani naxan daxa a don, a xa a wunla dindin bɔxɔni a bɛndɛn sa a yɛ ma. <verse eid="LEV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14"/>Amasɔtɔ suben birin niina a wunla nin. Nanara, n bata a fala Isirayila kaane xa, n naxa, ‘Ɛ nama sube yo wunla don, amasɔtɔ suben birin niina a wunla nin. Naxan yo a don, na kedima nɛn Isirayila yamani.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15"/>“Naxan na suben don naxan faxaxi a yɛtɛ ma hanma sube gbɛtɛ naxan faxaxi, a na findi Isirayila bari diin na hanma xɔɲɛna, na kanna lan a yi a dugine xa, a yi a maxa. A mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna, na xanbi ra a yi sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16"/>Xa a mi a dugine xa, xa a mi a maxa, a na hakɛn goronna tongoma nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18"/>
  <para style="s">Kafu feen sariyane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2"/>a xa ito nan fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala. <verse eid="LEV 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3"/>Ɛ nama Misiran kaane namunne liga, ɛ yi dɔxi dɛnaxan yi, hanma Kanan yamanan namunne, n na ɛ xalima dɛnaxan yi. Ɛ nama e namunne suxu de! <verse eid="LEV 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4"/>Ɛ xa n ma sariyane nun n ma tɔnne suxu bayo Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5"/>“Ɛ xa n ma tɔnne nun n ma sariyane suxu bayo naxan na e suxu, na kanna nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn e xɔn. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6"/>“Muxu yo nun a bari boden nama kafu. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7"/>“I nama i baba rayagi, ɛ nun i nga yi kafu. I nga na a ra. Ɛ nama kafu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8"/>“Ɛ nun i baba ɲaxalan gbɛtɛ nama kafu, na i baba rayagɛ nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9"/>“Ɛ nun i magilɛn nama kafu, i baba dii tɛmɛna hanma i nga dii tɛmɛna, hali ɛ mi maxuruxi tande kedenna ma.”<verse eid="LEV 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10"/>“Ɛ nun i mamandenna nama kafu i ya dii xɛmɛna dii tɛmɛna hanma i ya dii tɛmɛna dii tɛmɛna. Amasɔtɔ na i tan yagɛ nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11"/>“Ɛ nun i baba ɲaxalan gbɛtɛ a dii tɛmɛn nama kafu, a naxan barixi i baba ma. I magilɛn na a ra.”<verse eid="LEV 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12"/>“Ɛ nun i baba magilɛn nama kafu. I baba bari boden na a ra.”<verse eid="LEV 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13"/>“Ɛ nun i nga ngaxakeden ɲaxalanmaan nama kafu. I nga bari boden na a ra.”<verse eid="LEV 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14"/>“I nama i baba ngaxakedenna rayagi. Ɛ nun a ɲaxanla yi kafu. I nga xurin na a ra.”<verse eid="LEV 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15"/>“Ɛ nun i mamuxun nama kafu. I ya diina ɲaxanla na a ra. Ɛ nama kafu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16"/>“Ɛ nun i ngaxakedenna ɲaxanla nama kafu. Na i ngaxakedenna rayagɛ nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17"/>“Ɛ nun ɲaxanla nde nama kafu, ɛ nun a dii tɛmɛn fan yi kafu. Ɛ nun a mamandenna nama kafu, a dii xɛmɛna dii tɛmɛna hanma a dii tɛmɛna dii tɛmɛna. I bari boden nan ne ra. Na mi daxa.”<verse eid="LEV 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18"/>“I nama i ya ɲaxanla bari boden tongo i ya ɲaxanla ra, i ya ɲaxanla mɔn ɲɛɲɛ, alogo i nama yɛngɛn naso e tagi.”<verse eid="LEV 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19"/>“Ɛ nun ɲaxanla nama kafu a nɛma a kike wanli, amasɔtɔ a mi sariɲanxi.”<verse eid="LEV 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20"/>“Ɛ nun i lanfana ɲaxanla nama kafu, i yi i yɛtɛ xɔsi a xɔn.”<verse eid="LEV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21"/>“I nama i ya dii yo ba saraxan na Mɔlɔkɔ suxure kideni, i yi i ya Ala xili kala. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22"/>“Ɛ nun xɛmɛn nama kafu alo ɲaxanla. Xɔsi feen nan na ra.”<verse eid="LEV 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23"/>“Ɛ nun suben nama kafu, i yi i yɛtɛ xɔsi a xɔn. Ɲaxanla nama a maso suben na e kafu. Fe haramuxin nan na ra.”<verse eid="LEV 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24"/>“Ɛ nama ɛ xɔsi na kɛwali yo xɔn. Amasɔtɔ n siyaan naxanye kedima ɛ yɛɛ ra, ne e yɛtɛ xɔsi na feene nan xɔn. <verse eid="LEV 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25"/>E kɛwanle bɔxɔ yɛtɛɛn xɔsi nɛn. Nanara, n yi e hakɛne saran e ra, bɔxɔn yi a mɛ e ra. <verse eid="LEV 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26"/>Nayi, ɛ tan Isirayila kaane nun xɔɲɛn naxanye ɛ tagi, ɛ xa n ma tɔnne nun sariyane suxu. Ɛ nama xɔsi feni itoe liga de! <verse eid="LEV 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27"/>Amasɔtɔ naxanye yi dɔxi bɔxɔni ito yi benun ɛ tan, ne yi feni itoe birin ligama, e bɔxɔn naxɔsi. <verse eid="LEV 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28"/>Na bɔxɔn nama a mɛ ɛ fan na ɛ xɔsina fe ra, alo siyaan naxanye yi na benun ɛ tan. <verse eid="LEV 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29"/>Nanara, naxan yo na xɔsi feni ito nde liga, na kedima nɛn a yamani. <verse eid="LEV 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30"/>Ɛ xa n ma yamarine suxu, ɛ nama namun xɔsixi yo liga naxanye yi ligama mɛnni benun ɛ tan. Ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ xɔsi e xɔn. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 18:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yamaan nasariɲan fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2"/>a xa ito fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xa sariɲan, amasɔtɔ n tan sariɲan, n tan, Alatala, ɛ Ala. <verse eid="LEV 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3"/>Birin xa a nga nun a baba binya, a yi Matabu Lɔxɔne suxu. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4"/>“Ɛ nama suxurene batu, ɛ nama wure raxulunxin nafala ala maligane ra. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5"/>“Ɛ na bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan ba Alatala xa, ɛ xa a ba a faɲin na alogo a xa a rasuxu. <verse eid="LEV 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6"/>Saraxan suben xa don a faxa lɔxɔni hanma na xɔtɔn bode. Naxan na lu han a xii saxande lɔxɔni, ɛ xa na sa tɛɛni. <verse eid="LEV 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7"/>Xa ɛ nde don xii saxande lɔxɔni, na haramuxi, na mi rasuxuma. <verse eid="LEV 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8"/>Naxan na a don, na a hakɛn goronna tongoma nɛn. Amasɔtɔ a bata Alatalaa se rasariɲanxin naharamu. Na kanna kedima nɛn a yamani.”<verse eid="LEV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9"/>“Ɛ na malo xaban fɔlɔ, ɛ nama maala xaba han xɛɛn xɛdɛɛn xɔn. Ɛ nama tɔnsɔnne makentun naxanye na lu a xɔri ma. <verse eid="LEV 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10"/>I nama sansi bogi dɔnxɛne bolon langani, i nama xɔnne makɔ naxanye yolonxi. I xa ne lu yiigelitɔne nun xɔɲɛne xa. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11"/>“Ɛ nama muɲan ti. Ɛ nama wulen fala. Ɛ nama ɛ bode yanfa. <verse eid="LEV 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12"/>Ɛ nama ɛ kɔlɔ n xinli wulen fari, amasɔtɔ i ya Ala nan xili kalama. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13"/>“I nama i muxun boden yii seene tongo yanfan xɔn, i yi a ɲaxankata. I nama walikɛɛn saranna ramara i konni han na xɔtɔn bode.”<verse eid="LEV 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14"/>“I nama tuli xɔrin konbi, i nama sese sa danxutɔɔn yɛɛ ra naxan a rabirɛ, koni i xa gaxu Ala yɛɛ ra. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15"/>“Ɛ nama tinxintareya liga kiti sadeni. I nama yiigelitɔɔn nafisa, i nama nafulu kanna rafisa, koni i xa i adamadi boden makiti tinxinni. <verse eid="LEV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16"/>I nama i adamadi boden mafala yamaan tagi. I nama i adamadi boden tɔɲɛgɛ alogo a xa faxa. Alatala nan n tan na. <verse eid="LEV 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17"/>I nama i ngaxakedenna raɲaxu, koni i xa i adamadi boden maxadi, alogo i nama yulubin tongo a fe ra. <verse eid="LEV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18"/>I nama i gbeen ɲɔxɔ. I nama yamaan muxuna nde fe xɔnnantenyaan namara i kui. I adamadi boden xanu alo i yɛtɛna. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19"/>“Ɛ xa n ma tɔnne suxu. I nama sube siya firinne rakafu. I nama sansi siya firinna si xɛɛn ma. I nama gɛsɛ siya firinna dugi sɔxɔnxin so.”<verse eid="LEV 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde nun konyi gilɛna nde kafu, muxu gbɛtɛ naxan masuxi a ɲaxanla ra, naxan munma xunba hanma a xɔrɔya, e kala tixin saranma e ra nɛn. Koni e mi faxama, amasɔtɔ a munma yi xunba nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21"/>Xɛmɛn lan a kontonna xali Alatala yɛtagi Naralan Bubun dɛɛn na a yangin saraxan na. <verse eid="LEV 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22"/>Saraxaraliin xa yangin saraxa kontonna findi Alatala solona seen na a yulubi ligaxina fe ra, a yulubin yi xafari.”<verse eid="LEV 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23"/>“Ɛ na so na yamanani, n na ɛ xalima dɛnaxan yi, ɛ yi bogiseen siyaan birin si, ɛ xa tɔnna dɔxɔ e bogine ra. E haramuxi nɛn ɛ tan xa ɲɛɛ saxan, ɛ nama e don. <verse eid="LEV 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24"/>Ɲɛɛn naanindeni, bɔxɔn bogine birin nasariɲanma nɛn Alatala tantun seen na. <verse eid="LEV 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25"/>Ɲɛɛn suulundeni, ɛ nɔɛ e bogine donɲɛ nɛn. Nayi, ɛ bogi se sɔtɔxine sigan gbo ayi nɛn. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26"/>“Ɛ nama sese don wunla naxan yi. Ɛ nama ɛ yiimato, ɛ nama kɔɛrayaan liga. <verse eid="LEV 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27"/>Ɛ nama ɛ xunna dɛ bi a radigilinxin na. I nama i dɛ xaben dɛxɔnne bi. <verse eid="LEV 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28"/>Ɛ nama ɛ fatin mabɔ faxa feen sunun taxamasenna ra. Ɛ nama taxaraan te ɛ fatin ma. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29"/>“I nama i ya dii tɛmɛn nayagi i a findi yalunden na, alogo yamanan nama bira yalunyaan fɔxɔ ra, a yi rafe fe ɲaxin na. <verse eid="LEV 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30"/>Ɛ xa Matabu Lɔxɔne suxu, ɛ yi n ma yire sariɲanxin binya. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31"/>“Ɛ nama siga koron bɔnbɔne nun yiimatone fɛma, alogo e nama ɛ raxɔsi. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32"/>“I xa keli fonna bun binyeni. I xa fonne binya, i yi gaxu i ya Ala yɛɛ ra. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33"/>“Xa xɔɲɛn fa dɔxɔ ɛ yamanani, ɛ nama ɲaxu a ra, <verse eid="LEV 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34"/>koni ɛ xa a yisuxu alo yamanan bari diina ɛ tagi. I xa a xanu alo i yɛtɛna, amasɔtɔ ɛ findi xɔɲɛn na nɛn Misiran yamanani. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35"/>“Ɛ nama tinxintareya liga kiti sadeni, hanma se maligadeni, hanma se binyeni ligadeni, hanma se yiligadeni. <verse eid="LEV 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36"/>Ɛ sikeela xa tinxin. Ɛ nɛma sese maligɛ, ɛ xa ligase kamalixin nawali. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala, naxan ɛ ramini Misiran yamanani.”<verse eid="LEV 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37"/>“Ɛ xa n ma tɔnne nun sariyane birin suxu. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 19:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20"/>
  <para style="s">Sariya kalane saranna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa <verse eid="LEV 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 20:2">“Isirayila kaan hanma xɔɲɛn naxan dɔxi Isirayila bɔxɔni, xa na nde a diin ba saraxan na Mɔlɔkɔ suxure kideni, yamaan xa a magɔlɔn a faxa. <verse eid="LEV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3"/>N tan yɛtɛɛn kelima nɛn a xili ma, n yi a ba Isirayila yamaan yɛ. Amasɔtɔ a to a diin ba saraxan na Mɔlɔkɔ suxuren xa, a bata n ma yire sariɲanxin naxɔsi, a yi n xili sariɲanxin kala. <verse eid="LEV 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4"/>Xa yamaan bata e yɛɛne raxi na feen ma, e tondi na kanna faxɛ, naxan a diin baxi saraxan na Mɔlɔkɔ xa, <verse eid="LEV 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5"/>n tan yɛtɛɛn kelima nɛn a xili ma e nun a denbayana. N na a kedima nɛn Isirayila yamani e nun naxanye birin biraxi a fɔxɔ ra e n yanfa Mɔlɔkɔ suxure kideni.”<verse eid="LEV 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6"/>“Xa muxuna nde n yanfa, a bira koron bɔnbɔne nun yiimatone fɔxɔ ra, n kelima nɛn a xili ma, n yi a kedi a yamani. <verse eid="LEV 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7"/>Ɛ xa ɛ yɛtɛ suxu sariɲanni, alogo ɛ xa sariɲan amasɔtɔ Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8"/>“Ɛ xa n ma tɔnne suxu, ɛ yi e liga. Alatala nan n tan na, naxan ɛ rasariɲanma.”<verse eid="LEV 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9"/>“Naxan yo na a baba danga hanma a nga, ɛ na kanna faxa. A tan nan a faxa feen nagidixi, bayo a bata a baba danga hanma a nga.”<verse eid="LEV 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde yalunya liga e nun xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ a ɲaxanla, a lanfana ɲaxanla, ɛ xa xɛmɛ yalunxin nun ɲaxalan yalunxin firinne birin faxa.”<verse eid="LEV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde nun a baba ɲaxanla kafu, a bata a baba rayagi. Ɛ xa xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla firinne birin faxa. E tan yɛtɛɛn nan e faxa feen nagidixi. <verse eid="LEV 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12"/>Xa xɛmɛna nde nun a mamuxun kafu, ɛ xa e firinne birin faxa. Amasɔtɔ e bata fe ɲaxin liga. E tan nan e faxa feen nagidixi.”<verse eid="LEV 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde kafu xɛmɛn ma alo muxun kafun ɲaxanla ma kii naxan yi, e firinna birin bata xɔsi feen liga. Ɛ xa e firinna birin faxa. E tan nan e faxa feen nagidixi.”<verse eid="LEV 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde dii tɛmɛ nun a nga fen a ɲaxanla ra, fe ɲaxin nan na ra. Xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanle birin xa gan, alogo na fe ɲaxin nama lu ɛ tagi.”<verse eid="LEV 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde kafu suben ma, ɛ xa a faxa, ɛ yi suben faxa.”<verse eid="LEV 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16"/>“Xa ɲaxanla nde a maso suben na e yi kafu, ɛ xa ɲaxanla nun suben faxa. E xa faxa, e tan nan e faxa feen nagidixi.”<verse eid="LEV 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17"/>“Xa muxuna nde a magilɛn tongo a ɲaxanla ra, a baba a dii tɛmɛna hanma a nga a dii tɛmɛna, e yi kafu, yagin nan na ra. E xa kedi yamaan yɛ. Xɛmɛn bata kafu a magilɛn ma, a tan nan a hakɛn goronna tongoma.”<verse eid="LEV 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde kafu ɲaxanla ma a nɛma a kike wanli, e firinne birin xa kedi yamani bayo e lanxi e yagi feen ma nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19"/>“Ɛ nun i nga ngaxakedenna hanma i tɛnɛn nama kafu, bayo na i bari boden nayagima nɛn. Ɛ firinna birin ɛ hakɛn goronna tongoma nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde nun a sɔxɔ ɲaxanla kafu, a bata a sɔxɔ rayagi. E firinna nan e hakɛn goronna tongoma, e faxama nɛn e mi dii bari.”<verse eid="LEV 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21"/>“Xa xɛmɛna nde a ngaxakedenna ɲaxanla tongo a ɲaxanla ra, xɔsin nan na ra. A bata a ngaxakedenna rayagi. E mi dii barima.”<verse eid="LEV 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22"/>“Ɛ xa n ma tɔnne nun n ma sariyane birin suxu, ɛ yi e liga, alogo na bɔxɔn nama a mɛ ɛ ra, n na ɛ xalima bɔxɔn naxan yi dɔxɔdeni. <verse eid="LEV 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23"/>N siyaan naxanye kedima ɛ yɛɛ ra, ɛ nama bira ne namunne fɔxɔ ra. Amasɔtɔ e feni itoe birin ligaxi nɛn e yi raɲaxu n ma. <verse eid="LEV 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24"/>Koni n na a fala nɛn ɛ xa, n naxa, ‘E bɔxɔn soma ɛ tan nan yii. N na bɔxɔn fima ɛ ma nɛn ɛ kɛɛn na, kumin nun nɔnɔn gbo dɛnaxan yi.’ Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala, naxan ɛ sugandixi siyane tagi. <verse eid="LEV 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25"/>Nanara, ɛ xa sube haramuxine nun sube daxaxine tagi raba, e nun xɔli haramuxine nun a daxaxine. Ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ xɔsi subeni itoe xɔn, hanma xɔline xɔn, hanma niimaseen naxanye e masigama bɔxɔn ma, n tɔnna saxi naxanye ra a e haramuxi.”<verse eid="LEV 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26"/>“Nayi, ɛ findima n ma yama sariɲanxin na nɛn, amasɔtɔ n tan Alatala sariɲan. N bata ɛ sugandi siyane tagi, alogo ɛ xa findi n gbeen na.”<verse eid="LEV 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27"/>“Xɛmɛn hanma ɲaxanla naxan ɛ tagi, xa a findi koron bɔnbɔn na hanma yiimatoon na, ɛ xa a magɔlɔn a faxa. A tan nan a faxa feen nagidixi.”<verse eid="LEV 20:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxaraline sariɲanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a a xa a fala saraxaraline xa, Harunaa diine, a naxa, “Saraxaraliin nama a yɛtɛ xɔsi a muxuna nde ɲandeni, a a maso a binbin na. <verse eid="LEV 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2"/>Fɔ a muxu kɛndɛne alo itoe: a nga, a baba, a diina, a dii tɛmɛna, a tada hanma a xunyɛna, <verse eid="LEV 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3"/>hanma a magilɛn naxan munma futu, naxan dɔxi a konni bayo xɛmɛn mi a yii. A nɔɛ a yɛtɛ xɔsɛ nɛn e ɲandeni. <verse eid="LEV 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4"/>Koni, saraxaraliin naxan tixi yamaan yɛɛ ra, na nama a yɛtɛ xɔsi, a yɛtɛ rayagi. <verse eid="LEV 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5"/>Xa sayaan ti, saraxaraline mi lan e e xunne bi, hanma e e dɛ xabene dɛxɔn bi, hanma e e fatin mabɔ. <verse eid="LEV 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6"/>E xa sariɲan e Ala yɛtagi, e nama e Ala xili kala, amasɔtɔ e tan nan saraxane ralima Alatala ma tɛɛn na, naxanye luxi alo e Ala donsena. Nayi, e xa sariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7"/>E nama yalunden futu hanma ɲaxanla naxan xɛmɛ feen kolon hanma ɲaxanla naxan ma xɛmɛ a mɛxi a ra. Amasɔtɔ e rasariɲanxin na a ra Ala xa. <verse eid="LEV 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8"/>I xa a yatɛ muxu sariɲanxin na, amasɔtɔ a tan nan saraxane fima Ala ma naxanye luxi alo a donsena. Nanara, ɛ xa a kolon a sariɲan, amasɔtɔ n tan Alatala sariɲan, n tan nan ɛ rasariɲanma. <verse eid="LEV 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9"/>Xa saraxaralina diina nde a yɛtɛ rayagi a findi yalunden na, a a baba nan nayagixi. A xa gan.”<verse eid="LEV 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10"/>“Saraxarali kuntigin naxan bata masusan, a sugandi a ngaxakedenne tagi alogo a xa nɔ dugi rasariɲanxine sodeni, na nama a xunsɛxɛn lu a yitɔntaren na hanma a yi a dugine yibɔ ɲandeni. <verse eid="LEV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11"/>A nama so binbin xun ma. A nama a yɛtɛ xɔsi hali a baba na a ra hanma a nga. <verse eid="LEV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12"/>A nama mini yire sariɲanxin kui, hanma a yɛtɛ xɔsi, amasɔtɔ a rasariɲanxi Alaa masusan turen nan na. Alatala nan n tan na. <verse eid="LEV 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13"/>A xa sungutun nasɔlɔnxin tongo a ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="LEV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14"/>A nama kaɲa gilɛn tongo, hanma ɲaxanla beɲinxina hanma yalunde xɔsixina, koni a xa sungutun nasɔlɔnxin tongo a yamani, <verse eid="LEV 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15"/>alogo a nama a yixɛtɛne rayagi a yamaan tagi. Alatala nan n tan na naxan a rasariɲanma.”<verse eid="LEV 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17"/>a xa a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “I yixɛtɛn muxu madɔnxi yo nama wali saraxa rabadeni, a Ala donseen nali a ma. <verse eid="LEV 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18"/>Madɔntɔ yo mi daxa a a maso: danxutɔna, lɛbutɛnna, naxan yɛtagi madɔnxi, hanma naxan salen se madɔnxi, <verse eid="LEV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19"/>sankalatɔna hanma yiikalatɔna, <verse eid="LEV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20"/>dantɔna hanma tongona, teeli kanna, hanma kafanla muxun naxan ma, hanma naxan tɛgɛnxi. <verse eid="LEV 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21"/>Saraxarali Haruna yixɛtɛn madɔnxi yo nama a maso, a yi saraxane rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na. Madɔntɔɔn na a ra, a mi lan a a maso, a Ala donseen nali a ma. <verse eid="LEV 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22"/>A nɔɛ Alaa donse sariɲanxin sifan birin donɲɛ nɛn, hali naxanye sariɲan han. <verse eid="LEV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23"/>Koni a madɔntɔyana fe ra, a mi lan a yi a maso yire sariɲanxin yɛ masansan dugin na hanma saraxa gandena. A nama n ma yire sariɲanxina fe kala. Alatala nan n tan na, naxan saraxaraline rasariɲanma.” <verse eid="LEV 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24"/>Musa yi na falane rali Haruna nun a diine ma, e nun Isirayila kaane birin.<verse eid="LEV 21:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxane sariɲanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2"/>a xa a fala Haruna nun a diine xa, a Isirayila kaane na saraxa sariɲanxin naxanye fi n ma, e xa ne suxu ki faɲi e don kiin ma alogo e nama n xili sariɲanxin kala. Alatala nan n tan na.<verse eid="LEV 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3"/>A fala e xa, i naxa, “Xa ɛ yixɛtɛ yo mi sariɲan waxati famatɔne yi, a a maso Isirayila kaane saraxane ra e naxanye ralima Alatala ma, na kanna kedima nɛn n yɛtagi. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4"/>“Xa fure ɲaxin bata mini Haruna yixɛtɛna nde fatin ma, hanma furen yi a bari boden suxu, na mi lan a saraxa sariɲanxine don benun a xa rasariɲan. A mɔn mi sariɲanxi xa a bata a yiin din sena nde ra naxan bata din muxun binbin na, hanma igen sifana nde naxan minixi muxun xɛmɛyani, <verse eid="LEV 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5"/>hanma a na a yiin din bubu seen na hanma muxun naxan mi sariɲan, hanma a findi se xɔsixi yo ra. <verse eid="LEV 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6"/>Naxan na a yiin din na se sifan na, na mi fa sariɲanxi han ɲinbanna. A nama saraxa sariɲanxine don, han a yi a fatin birin maxa. <verse eid="LEV 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7"/>Sogen na godo, a bata sariɲan. Na xanbi ra, a nɔɛ saraxa sariɲanxine donɲɛ sɔnɔn, amasɔtɔ a balon na a ra. <verse eid="LEV 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8"/>A nama suben don naxan faxaxi a yɛtɛ ma hanma burunna subene naxan yibɔxi, alogo a nama a yɛtɛ xɔsi a xɔn. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9"/>“Saraxaraline xa n ma yamarine suxu alogo e nama yulubin tongo, e faxa e kalane fe ra. Alatala nan n tan na, naxan e rasariɲanma. <verse eid="LEV 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10"/>Muxu yo nama saraxa sariɲanxin don xa a mi saraxaralina denbayani. Hali saraxaralina muxu xilixina hanma a walikɛɛn mi daxa a a don. <verse eid="LEV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11"/>Koni xa saraxaraliin bata konyina nde sara, hanma naxan barixi a konni, na nɔɛ a donɲɛ nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12"/>Xa muxuna nde saraxaralina dii tɛmɛn dɔxɔ a ɲaxanla ra, saraxarali mi a tan na, dii tɛmɛn nama fa saraxa sariɲanxine don. <verse eid="LEV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13"/>Koni xa saraxaralina dii tɛmɛn findi kaɲa gilɛn na hanma a futun yi kala, dii mi a yii, a xɛtɛ a baba konni alo a to yi dii ɲɔrɛyani, a nɔɛ a baba donseen donɲɛ nɛn. Koni naxan mi saraxaralina denbayani, na nama a don. <verse eid="LEV 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14"/>Xa muxuna nde a saraxa sariɲanxin don tantanni, a lan a yi a ɲɔxɔn fi, a mɔn yi yaganna dɔxɔɲa ma firin sa a fari a yanginna ra. <verse eid="LEV 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15"/>Saraxaraline nama Isirayila kaane saraxa sariɲanxine kala e naxan bama Alatala xa. <verse eid="LEV 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16"/>Xa e tin yamaan yi saraxa sariɲanxine don, e bata e findi yulubi tongone ra, yanginna fima naxan ma fe ra. Alatala nan n tan na, naxan e rasariɲanma.”<verse eid="LEV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18"/>a xa a fala Haruna nun a diine nun Isirayila kaane birin xa, a naxa, “Isirayila kaan birin hanma xɔɲɛne Isirayila yi, naxan saraxa gan daxin bama Alatala xa, dɛ tiin nakamalina fe ra, hanma ɲɛnige ma saraxana, <verse eid="LEV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19"/>a lan a yi fa turaan na hanma kontonna, hanma kɔtɔna fɛ mi naxan na. <verse eid="LEV 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20"/>Fɛɛn xuruseen naxan na, a mi lan ɛ yi fa na ra, amasɔtɔ a mi rasuxuma ɛ xa. <verse eid="LEV 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21"/>Xa muxuna nde fa xuruse gbeen na hanma a xunxurina, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na Alatala xa, hanma dɛ tiin nakamali saraxana hanma ɲɛnige ma saraxana, fɛ yo nama lu a ra alogo a xa rasuxu. <verse eid="LEV 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22"/>Nayi, ɛ nama fa xuruse yɛɛtaren na, ɛ a rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na n ma saraxa ganden fari, hanma naxan madɔnxi, hanma a maxɔlɔxi, hanma furen naxan fatin ma hanma kaban naxan ma. <verse eid="LEV 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23"/>Ɲingena hanma yɛxɛɛna naxan salen se kuya hanma a dungi, i nɔɛ na bɛ nɛn ɲɛnige ma saraxan na, koni a mi rasuxɛ dɛ tiin nakamali saraxan na. <verse eid="LEV 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24"/>Ɛ nama fa xuruseen na Alatala xɔn naxan tɛgɛnxi, a dɛlane kalaxi, hanma e baxi na. Ɛ nama na ba saraxan na ɛ yamanani. <verse eid="LEV 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25"/>Ɛ nama na xuruse sifan nasuxu xɔɲɛne yii, ɛ a ba donse saraxan na ɛ Ala xa. Amasɔtɔ e tɛgɛnxi. Fɛna e ra. E mi rasuxɛ ɛ xa.”<verse eid="LEV 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27"/>“Ɲingena, yɛxɛɛna hanma siin na bari, a xa lu a nga bun xii solofere. Xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni e nun na xanbi ra, a rasuxɛ nɛn saraxan na, naxan nalima Alatala ma tɛɛn na. <verse eid="LEV 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28"/>Ɲingena hanma yɛxɛɛna, ɛ nama e nun a diin kɔɛ raxaba lɔxɔ kedenni. <verse eid="LEV 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29"/>Xa ɛ barika bira saraxan ba Alatala xa, ɛ xa a ba ki faɲi alogo a xa rasuxu. <verse eid="LEV 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30"/>A donma na lɔxɔn yɛtɛɛn nin. Ɛ nama sese lu han xɔtɔnni. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31"/>“Ɛ n ma yamarine suxu ɛ yi e liga. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32"/>“Ɛ nama n xili sariɲanxin kala, alogo n xa lu sariɲanni ɛ tagi, ɛ tan Isirayila kaane. Alatala nan n tan na, naxan ɛ rasariɲanma. <verse eid="LEV 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33"/>N tan nan ɛ ramini Misiran yamanani, n yi findi ɛ Ala ra. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila yamana sali lɔxɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Sali lɔxɔne ni itoe ra Alatala xa, ɛ yamaan xilima malan sariɲanxini waxatin naxan yi. Sali lɔxɔne ni itoe ra n xa. <verse eid="LEV 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3"/>Ɛ xa wali xii sennin, koni xii soloferede lɔxɔn findixi Matabu Lɔxɔn nan na, malan sariɲanxin tima lɔxɔn naxan ma. Ɛ nama wali yo kɛ. Ɛ xa Matabu Lɔxɔn findi Alatala gbeen na ɛ nɛma dɔxi dɛdɛ yi.”<verse eid="LEV 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Yatɛne 28.16-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4"/>“Sali lɔxɔn bonne ni i ra Alatala xa. Ɛ xa yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini waxatini itoe yi: <verse eid="LEV 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5"/>Kike singen xii fu nun naaninna, fitirin ma, Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla nan na ra Alatala xa. <verse eid="LEV 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6"/>Na kiken xii fu nun suulundena, Buru Tetaren Sanla nan na ra Alatala xa. Ɛ xa buru ratetarene don xii solofere. <verse eid="LEV 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7"/>Xii singeni, ɛ xa malan sariɲanxin maxili. Na lɔxɔni, ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8"/>Ɛ xa saraxane rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na xii solofere. Xii soloferede lɔxɔni, ɛ mɔn yi malan sariɲanxin maxili. Na lɔxɔni, ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ.”<verse eid="LEV 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “N bɔxɔn naxan soma ɛ yii, ɛ na so mɛnni, ɛ se xaban fɔlɔ, ɛ xa fa ɛ bogise singen xidin na saraxaraliin fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11"/>Saraxaraliin xa a yita Alatala ra Matabu Lɔxɔn xɔtɔn bode, alogo a xa a rasuxu ɛ yii. <verse eid="LEV 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12"/>Ɛ se xidin yitama Ala ra lɔxɔ naxan yi, ɛ xa yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ kedenna ba saraxa gan daxin na Alatala xa, fɛ mi naxan na, <verse eid="LEV 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13"/>e nun bogise saraxana, murutu fuɲin kilo sennin naxan basanxi turen na. Na xa rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na, naxan xiri rafan a ma, e nun minse saraxan wudi bogi igen litiri keden e nun a tagi. <verse eid="LEV 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14"/>Burun ba, tɔnsɔn ganxine ba, a xindene ba, ɛ nama se xabaxi yo don benun ɛ xa fa na saraxane ra ɛ Ala xa. Habadan sariyan nan na ra ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa, ɛ na dɔxɔ dɛdɛ yi.”<verse eid="LEV 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Yatɛne 28.26-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15"/>“Keli Matabu Lɔxɔn xɔtɔn bode, ɛ malo xidin yitama Ala ra lɔxɔn naxan yi, xunsagi solofere xa dangu. <verse eid="LEV 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16"/>Xii tonge suulundeni, Matabu Lɔxɔ solofereden xɔtɔn bode, ɛ mɔn xa bogise xaba nɛnɛn fi Alatala ma bogise saraxan na. <verse eid="LEV 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17"/>Ɛ xa murutu fuɲin kilo saxan nafala buru ratexin na, ɛ fa na buru xun firin na bogise singe saraxa ralixin na Alatala xa. <verse eid="LEV 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18"/>Yamaan mɔn xa kontondi solofere ba saraxan na ɲɛɛ keden kedenne fɛ mi naxanye ra, e nun tura bulan keden nun konton firin, sa bogise saraxa burune fari e nun bogise saraxane nun minse saraxan naxanye daxa. Saraxa gan daxin nan ne ra, naxanye ralima Alatala ma tɛɛn na, e xirin yi rafan a ma. <verse eid="LEV 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna firin bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. <verse eid="LEV 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20"/>Saraxaraliin xa yɛxɛɛ firin nun bogise singen burun yita n na se ralixin na. E rasariɲanma Alatala xa nɛn, e yi so saraxaraliin yii. <verse eid="LEV 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21"/>Na lɔxɔn yɛtɛni, ɛ xa yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini. Ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ na lɔxɔni. Habadan sariyan na a ra ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa, ɛ na dɔxɔ dɛdɛ yi. <verse eid="LEV 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22"/>Ɛ na malo xaban fɔlɔ, ɛ nama maala xaba han xɛɛn xɛdɛɛn xɔn, ɛ nama tɔnsɔnne makentun naxanye na lu a xɔri ma. I xa ne lu yiigelitɔne xa e nun xɔɲɛne. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 29:1-6">Yatɛne 29.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Kike solofereden xii singeni, ɛ xa ɛ matabu na lɔxɔni ɛ yi a binya, ɛ xɔtaan fe, ɛ yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini. <verse eid="LEV 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25"/>Ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ na lɔxɔni, ɛ xa saraxane rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na.”<verse eid="LEV 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala Solona lɔxɔna</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Yatɛne 29.7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27"/>“Kike solofereden xii fuden xa findi Ala Solona Lɔxɔn na. Ɛ xa malan sariɲanxin ti, ɛ yi sunna suxu, ɛ yi saraxane rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na. <verse eid="LEV 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28"/>Ɛ nama ɛ wali yo kɛ na lɔxɔni, amasɔtɔ Ala Solona Lɔxɔn na a ra. Alatala solonama ɛ xa na lɔxɔn nin, ɛ Ala. <verse eid="LEV 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29"/>Xa naxan yo mi sunna suxu na lɔxɔni, na kedima nɛn a yamani. <verse eid="LEV 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30"/>Xa naxan yo wali na lɔxɔni, n na a raxɔrima nɛn a yamaan yɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31"/>Ɛ nama wali yo kɛ. Habadan sariyan na a ra ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa, ɛ na dɔxɔ dɛdɛ yi. <verse eid="LEV 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32"/>Matabu Lɔxɔn na a ra ɛ xa e nun sali lɔxɔna. Ɛ xa sunna suxu. Ɛ xa matabu sanla raba keli kiken xii solomanaaninden ɲinbanna ma han na xɔtɔn bode ɲinbanna.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bubu Kui Sanla</para>
  <para style="r">Yatɛne 29.12-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Kike solofereden xii fu nun suulundeni, Bubu Kui Sanla na ra Alatala xinli, han xii solofere. <verse eid="LEV 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35"/>Sanla xii singeni, malan sariɲanxin tima nɛn, ɛ nama ɛ wali yo kɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36"/>Xii solofere, ɛ xa saraxane rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na. Xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni, ɛ mɔn xa malan sariɲanxin ti, ɛ mɔn yi saraxane rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na. Malan sariɲanxin na a ra, ɛ nama ɛ wali yo kɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37"/>Sali lɔxɔne nan ne ra Alatala xa, ɛ yamaan xilima malan sariɲanxini lɔxɔn naxanye yi, alogo ɛ xa saraxane rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na, saraxa gan daxine nun bogise saraxane nun saraxa gbɛtɛye, e nun minse saraxane, naxanye daxa sali lɔxɔne yi. <verse eid="LEV 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38"/>Saraxani itoe sama Alatalaa Matabu Lɔxɔne saraxane fari nɛn, e nun ɛ kiseene nun ɛ dɛ tiin nakamali saraxane, e nun ɛ ɲɛnige ma saraxane ɛ naxanye birin fima Alatala ma.”<verse eid="LEV 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39"/>“Kike solofereden xii fu nun suulunde lɔxɔni, ɛ na yelin bogi seene malandeni xɛɛn ma, ɛ xa sanla raba Alatala xa xii solofere. Xii singen nun xii solomasɛxɛden findin Matabu Lɔxɔne nan na. <verse eid="LEV 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40"/>Xii singe lɔxɔni, ɛ xa bogise faɲine ba wudine kɔɛ ra, e nun tugu yiine, e nun ɲɔxɔndene, e nun wudi yii gbɛtɛye, ɛ yi sɛwa Alatala yɛtagi ɛ Ala han xii solofere. <verse eid="LEV 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41"/>Ɛ xa sanli ito raba Alatala xa ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ, xii solofere. Habadan sariyan na a ra ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa. Ɛ sanla raba ɲɛɛn kike soloferedeni. <verse eid="LEV 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42"/>Ɛ xa dɔxɔ bubune kui xii solofere. Isirayila bari diine birin xa lu bubune kui, <verse eid="LEV 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43"/>alogo ɛ yixɛtɛne xa a kolon fa fala n na e benbane radɔxɔ nɛn bubune kui, n to ɛ ramini Misiran bɔxɔni. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44"/>Musa Alatalaa sali lɔxɔne fala na kii nin Isirayila kaane xa.<verse eid="LEV 23:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yire sariɲanxin lɛnpu dɔxɔ sena</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 27.20,21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2"/>“A yamari Isirayila kaane ma a e xa fa oliwi ture faɲin na i xɔn, alogo lɛnpune xa dɛgɛ waxatin birin. <verse eid="LEV 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3"/>Haruna xa a yengi lu lɛnpune xɔn Layiri Kankiraan yɛ masansan dugin fari ma Naralan Bubun kui, alogo e xa dɛgɛ Alatala yɛtagi keli ɲinbanna ma han xɔtɔnni waxatin birin. Habadan sariyan na a ra ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa. <verse eid="LEV 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4"/>Haruna xa a yengi lu lɛnpune xɔn kɔɛɛn birin na naxanye dɔxi lɛnpu dɔxɔ se xɛma daxin fari Alatala yɛtagi.”<verse eid="LEV 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5"/>“Murutu fuɲin tongo i yi buru fu nun firin nafala. Burune keden kedenna birin binyen xa kilo sennin li. <verse eid="LEV 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6"/>I xa e dɔxɔ yɛlan firin nin xɛma tabanla fari Alatala yɛtagi, sennin sennin yɛ ma. <verse eid="LEV 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7"/>I xa wusulan faɲin sa burune birin fari, naxan nalima Alatala ma tɛɛn na burun ɲɔxɔn na ɲɔxɔ lu seen na Ala xɔn. <verse eid="LEV 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8"/>Buruni itoe xa dɔxɔ Alatala yɛtagi Matabu Lɔxɔn birin yi. Habadan layirin na a ra Isirayila kaane xa. <verse eid="LEV 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9"/>Burune xa raxɛtɛ Haruna nun a diine ma, e yi e don yire sariɲanxini. Amasɔtɔ se sariɲanxin na a ra na saraxane yɛ, naxanye ralima Alatala ma tɛɛn na, naxanye so saraxaraline yii. Habadan sariyan na a ra.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala rayelefun nun gbalona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10"/>Lɔxɔna nde muxuna nde yi mini Isirayila kaane yɛ, a nga Isirayila kaa, a baba Misiran kaa. Na kanna nun Isirayila kaana nde yi yɛngɛ yamaan daaxadeni. <verse eid="LEV 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11"/>Isirayila ɲaxanla diin yi Ala xinla rayelefu, a yi a konbi. A nga yi xili nɛn Selomiti, Dibiri a dii tɛmɛna Dan bɔnsɔnni. Mafurɛn e yi a xali Musa fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12"/>E yi a ramara a faɲin na han Alatala yɛtɛɛn yi a fe yɛba e xa.<verse eid="LEV 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="LEV 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14"/>“Naxan konbin tixi, na ramini yamaan daaxaden fari ma. Naxanye birin a xuiin mɛxi, ne birin xa e yiine ti a xunna ma, yamaan birin yi a magɔlɔn han a faxa. <verse eid="LEV 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15"/>I xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa iki, i naxa, ‘Naxan na Ala konbi, a lan a yi a yulubin goronna tongo. <verse eid="LEV 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16"/>Naxan na Alatala xinla rayelefu, na xa faxa, yamaan birin xa a magɔlɔn. Xa a findi xɔɲɛn na hanma Isirayila kaana, a na Alatala xinla rayelefu, a faxama nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17"/>Naxan na muxuna nde faxa, ɛ xa na kanna faxa. <verse eid="LEV 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18"/>Naxan na muxuna nde a suben faxa, a lan a yi a ɲɔxɔn so a yii. Niin ɲɔxɔn xa fi niin na. <verse eid="LEV 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19"/>Naxan na a boden maxɔlɔ, a fan xa maxɔlɔ na kiini. <verse eid="LEV 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20"/>Maxɔlɔn ɲɔxɔn nan maxɔlɔn na, yɛɛn ɲɔxɔn nan yɛɛn na, ɲinna ɲɔxɔn nan ɲinna ra. A xa maxɔlɔ alo a a ligaxi boden na kii naxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21"/>Naxan na suben faxa a lan a yi a ɲɔxɔn fi, koni naxan na muxun faxa a lan a yi faxa. <verse eid="LEV 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22"/>Sariya kedenna na a ra ɛ birin xa, xɔɲɛna hanma Isirayila kaana. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23"/>Musa yi falan ti Isirayila kaane xa. Xɛmɛn naxan konbin tixi, e yi na xali yamaan daaxaden fari ma, e yi a magɔlɔn, a faxa. Isirayila kaane yi a liga alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="LEV 24:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25"/>
  <para style="s">Matabu ɲɛɛna</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 15:1-11">Sariyane 15.1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa Sinayi geyaan fari, <verse eid="LEV 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ na so na bɔxɔni n naxan soma ɛ yii, bɔxɔn yɛtɛɛn xa a matabu Alatala xinli. <verse eid="LEV 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3"/>Ɛ nɔɛ ɛ xɛɛne biyɛ nɛn ɲɛɛ sennin, ɛ manpa bili nakɔne wali, ɛ yi e bogine malan. <verse eid="LEV 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4"/>Koni ɲɛɛ solofereden findin matabu ɲɛɛn nan na Alatala xinli. Ɛ nama ɛ xɛɛne bi hanma ɛ yi ɛ manpa bili nakɔne wali. <verse eid="LEV 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5"/>Sansi bogin naxanye na soli e yɛtɛ ma, i tan nama e malan i yɛtɛ xa. I tan nama manpa tɔnsɔn mɔxine malan naxanye bogixi e yɛtɛ ma. Amasɔtɔ matabu ɲɛɛn na ra bɔxɔn xa. <verse eid="LEV 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6"/>Koni bɔxɔn na naxan namini matabu ɲɛɛn kui, ɛ birin xa na don, i tan, i ya konyi xɛmɛna, i ya konyi gilɛna, i ya walikɛna, xɔɲɛn naxan luma i konni, <verse eid="LEV 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7"/>e nun i ya xuruseene, e nun hali burunna suben naxanye i ya bɔxɔni. Bɔxɔn na naxan namini, na birin nɔɛ donɲɛ nɛn.”<verse eid="LEV 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɔrɔya ɲɛɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8"/>“Ɛ xa matabu ɲɛɛ solofere tɛngɛ, ɲɛɛ solofere dɔxɔ solofere, alogo matabu ɲɛɛ soloferene xa lan ɲɛɛ tonge naanin e nun solomanaaninna ma. <verse eid="LEV 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9"/>Kike solofereden xii fudeni, Ala Solona Lɔxɔna, ɛ xa xɔtane fe yamanan birin yi. <verse eid="LEV 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10"/>Ɛ ɲɛɛ tonge suulunden nasariɲanma nɛn, ɛ yi a rali yiren birin yi a yamanan muxune birin bata xɔrɔya. Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛn na a ra ɛ xa, ɛ birin yi xɛtɛ ɛ denbayana bɔxɔn ma ɛ bɔnsɔnne yi. <verse eid="LEV 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11"/>Ɲɛɛ tonge suulunden findima Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛn nan na ɛ xa. Ɛ nama ɛ xɛɛne bi, ɛ nama sansi bogine malan naxanye solima e yɛtɛ ma. Ɛ nama manpa bogi tɔnsɔnne malan naxanye bogima e yɛtɛ ma. <verse eid="LEV 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12"/>Amasɔtɔ Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛn nan na ra. A sariɲan ɛ xa. Ɛ na donseen naxan to xɛɛne ma, ɛ xa na don.”<verse eid="LEV 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13"/>“Na Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛna, birin xa xɛtɛ a gbee bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="LEV 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14"/>Xa ɛ bɔxɔna nde mati hanma ɛ a sara muxuna nde ma, ɛ nama ɲaxu ɛ bode ra. <verse eid="LEV 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15"/>I a saren naxan soma i kon kaan yii, na xa lan na ɲɛɛne yatɛn ma naxan luxi benun Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛn xa a li. A xa a saren nasuxu i yii naxan lanɲɛ se xaba waxatine yatɛn ma naxanye luxi. <verse eid="LEV 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16"/>Xa ɲɛɛ wuyaxi luxi, a saren xa mate na kiini. Xa ɲɛɛ dando nan luxi a xa a saren magodo. Amasɔtɔ a mi bɔxɔn matima, fɔ se xaba waxatine. <verse eid="LEV 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17"/>Ɛ nama ɲaxu ɛ bode ra, koni ɛ xa gaxu ɛ Ala yɛɛ ra. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18"/>“Ɛ xa n ma tɔnne nun sariyane suxu. Nayi, ɛ luma nɛn yamanani bɔɲɛ xunbenli. <verse eid="LEV 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19"/>Bɔxɔn yi bogi seene fi, ɛ yi ɛ dɛge han ɛ lugo, ɛ lu bɔɲɛ xunbenli. <verse eid="LEV 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20"/>Waxatina nde ɛ a falama nɛn, ɛ naxa, ‘En nanse donma ɲɛɛ soloferedeni, xa en mi xɛɛn bi, en mi seen xaba?’ <verse eid="LEV 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21"/>N barakan sama nɛn ɛ feene yi ɲɛɛ sennindeni, alogo ɛ se xabaxin xa ɛ makone birin fan han ɲɛɛ saxan. <verse eid="LEV 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22"/>Ɲɛɛ solomasɛxɛdeni, ɛ nɛma ɛ xɛɛne bima, ɛ donse ramaraxin nan donma. Ɛ luma a donɲɛ nɛn han ɲɛɛn solomanaaninden se xaba waxatini.”<verse eid="LEV 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23"/>“Ɛ nama bɔxɔn mati habadanni mumɛ, amasɔtɔ n tan nan gbee bɔxɔn na. Ɛ tan luxi nɛn alo xɔɲɛn naxanye yigiyaxi n konni. <verse eid="LEV 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24"/>Nanara, ɛ na yamanan sɔtɔ, ɛ xa sariyan dɔxɔ alogo bɔxɔ matixin xa xunba.”<verse eid="LEV 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25"/>“Xa i ngaxakedenna findi yiigelitɔɔn na, a yi a bɔxɔna nde mati, a bari bodena nde xa fa a bɔxɔ matixin xunba. <verse eid="LEV 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26"/>Xa a bari bode mi na naxan daxa a a xunba, xa a tan yɛtɛɛn bata a xunba fɛrɛn sɔtɔ, <verse eid="LEV 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27"/>a xa ɲɛɛne yatɛ keli a saran ma, a yi na ɲɔxɔn naxɛtɛ a sara muxun ma. Na xanbi, a nɔɛ xɛtɛ nɛn a bɔxɔni. <verse eid="LEV 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28"/>Koni, xa a mi a ɲɔxɔ raxɛtɛ se sɔtɔ, bɔxɔn xa lu a sara muxun yii han Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛna. Na waxatini a kari singen mɔn xa xɛtɛ a bɔxɔni. <verse eid="LEV 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29"/>Xa muxuna nde a banxin mati taa gbeeni yinna soxi naxan ma, a nɔɛ a xunbɛ nɛn han ɲɛɛ keden a sara xanbini. <verse eid="LEV 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30"/>Koni xa banxin mi xunba benun ɲɛɛ keden, a luma nɛn a sara muxun gbeeyani sɔnɔn e nun a yixɛtɛne. A mi a raxɛtɛma Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛni. <verse eid="LEV 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31"/>Koni banxin naxanye taa xunxurine yi naxanye mi rabilinxi yinna ra, ne luma nɛn alo bɔxɔna. E nɔɛ xunbɛ nɛn, e mɔn yi raxɛtɛ e kari singen ma Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛni.”<verse eid="LEV 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32"/>“Lewi bɔnsɔnna taane kui, Lewine nɔɛ e banxine xunbɛ nɛn waxatin birin. <verse eid="LEV 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33"/>Naxan na Lewi kaana nde a banxin sara, a minima nɛn banxi saraxin nun na taani Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛni. Amasɔtɔ banxin naxanye Lewi taane yi, ne findixi Lewine nan gbansan gbee ra Isirayila yamanani. <verse eid="LEV 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34"/>Koni xɛɛn naxanye e taane rabilinni, ne mi lan e mati, amasɔtɔ Lewine nan gbee e ra habadan!”<verse eid="LEV 25:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Donla feen sariyane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35"/>“Xa i ngaxakedenna findi yiigelitɔɔn na, naxan dɔxi i fɛma, fɛrɛn mi fa a yii a balo, i lan i yi a maso i ra alo xɔɲɛna alogo a xa lu i fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36"/>I nama tɔnɔ yo maxɔdin a ma koni i xa gaxu i ya Ala yɛɛ ra, i ngaxakedenna yi lu i fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37"/>Xa i a doli gbetini, i nama tɔnɔ sa a fari. Xa i donseen mati a ma, i nama tɔnɔn sɔtɔ a xɔn.”<verse eid="LEV 25:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38"/>“Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala, naxan ɛ raminixi Misiran bɔxɔni alogo n xa Kanan bɔxɔn so ɛ yii, n yi findi ɛ Ala ra.”<verse eid="LEV 25:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxun xunba sariyana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39"/>“Xa muxuna nde findi yiigelitɔɔn na i dɛxɔn, a yi a yɛtɛ mati i ma, i nama a ti konyi wanla ra. <verse eid="LEV 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40"/>A xa masuxu i konni alo walikɛna hanma xɔɲɛna. A xa lu i ya wanla ra han Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛna. <verse eid="LEV 25:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41"/>Na waxatini, e nun a diine yi xɔrɔya, a yi xɛtɛ a xabilani, e nun a benbane bɔxɔni. <verse eid="LEV 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42"/>Amasɔtɔ n ma walikɛne nan Isirayila kaane ra, n naxanye raminixi Misiran yamanani. E nama mati konyiyani. <verse eid="LEV 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43"/>I nama e ɲaxankata, fɔ i xa gaxu i ya Ala yɛɛ ra.”<verse eid="LEV 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44"/>“Xa ɛ konyi xɛmɛn hanma konyi gilɛn sara, a xa keli siya gbɛtɛne yɛ naxanye ɛ rabilinxi. <verse eid="LEV 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45"/>Ɛ mɔn nɔɛ xɔɲɛna ndee sarɛ nɛn naxanye dɔxi ɛ yɛ, e nun e xabilan muxuna nde naxanye barixi ɛ yamanani. E yi findi ɛ gbeen na. <verse eid="LEV 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46"/>Ɛ mɔn nɔɛ e luyɛ ɛ diine yii nɛn ɛ kɛɛn na, alogo e xa lu konyiyani habadan. Koni ɛ ngaxakedenne, Isirayila kaane, ɛ tan sese nama nɔɔn sɔtɔ a ngaxakedenna xun na, a a ɲaxankata.”<verse eid="LEV 25:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47"/>“Xa xɔɲɛn findi nafulu kanna ra naxan dɔxi ɛ konni, ɛ ngaxakedenna nde yi findi yiigelitɔɔn na, a a yɛtɛ mati xɔɲɛn ma, hanma xɔɲɛn xabila muxu gbɛtɛ ma, <verse eid="LEV 25:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48"/>a nɔɛ xunbɛ nɛn a mati xanbini. A ngaxakedenna nde nɔɛ a xunbɛ nɛn, <verse eid="LEV 25:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49"/>hanma a sɔxɔna, hanma a dunbode, hanma a bari bodena nde a xabilani, na nɔɛ a ligɛ nɛn. A tan yɛtɛɛn nɔɛ a yɛtɛ xunbɛ nɛn, xa a fɛrɛn sɔtɔ. <verse eid="LEV 25:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50"/>Nayi, e nun a sara muxun xa ɲɛɛne yatɛ keli a sara ɲɛɛn ma han Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛna. A xa a ɲɔxɔn fi alo walikɛɛn nɔɛ saranna yatɛn naxan sɔtɛ na ɲɛɛne bun. <verse eid="LEV 25:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51"/>Ɲɛɛn dɔnxɛn naxanye luxi, xa ne mɔn gbo, a xa ne xasabin gbetin naxɛtɛ nafulu kanna ma a xunba saren na. <verse eid="LEV 25:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52"/>Ɲɛɛn naxanye luxi benun Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛn yi a li, xa ne mi fa gbo, a xa na fan xasabin gbetin naxɛtɛ a xunba saren na. <verse eid="LEV 25:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53"/>A yisuxuma nɛn a kanna konni alo walikɛɛn naxan sare fixi, a nama a ɲaxankata. <verse eid="LEV 25:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54"/>Xa a mi xunba na kii yo yi, e nun a diine xa xɔrɔya Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛni. <verse eid="LEV 25:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55"/>Amasɔtɔ n ma walikɛne nan Isirayila kaane ra. N gbee walikɛne nan e ra, n naxanye raminixi Misiran bɔxɔni. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 25:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26"/>
  <para style="s">Barakan nun dangana</para>
  <para style="r">Sariyane 7.12-24 nun 28.1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1"/>“Ɛ nama suxurene rafala. Ɛ nama alana nde sawuran nafala. Ɛ nama gɛmɛn dɔxɔ, ɛ yi a batu. Ɛ nama gɛmɛ masolixin ti ɛ yamanani ɛ yi a batu. Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="LEV 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2"/>“Ɛ xa n ma Matabu Lɔxɔne suxu, ɛ yi n ma yire sariɲanxin binya. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3"/>“Xa ɛ n ma tɔnne nun yamarine suxu, <verse eid="LEV 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4"/>n tulen nafama nɛn ɛ ma a waxatini, bɔxɔn yi balon fi, wudine yi bogi xɛɛne ma. <verse eid="LEV 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5"/>Se bɔnbɔ waxatin buma nɛn han bogise bolon waxatina. Bogi seene yi lu bolonɲɛ han xɛɛ bi waxatina. Ɛ dɛgema nɛn han ɛ lugo, ɛ yi lu ɛ bɔxɔni bɔɲɛ xunbenli. <verse eid="LEV 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6"/>N tinma nɛn yamanan yi lu hɛrini. Ɛ na ɛ sa, sese mi ɛ tɔrɛ. N burunna sube xaɲɛne bama nɛn ɛ yamanani, yɛngɛn mi soɛ ɛ konni. <verse eid="LEV 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7"/>Ɛ ɛ yaxune kedima nɛn, e yi bira ɛ bun yɛngɛni. <verse eid="LEV 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8"/>Ɛ tan muxu suulun fama nɛn ɛ yaxun muxu kɛmɛ kedideni. Ɛ tan muxu kɛmɛ yi ɛ yaxun wuli fu kedi. Ɛ yaxune birama nɛn ɛ bun yɛngɛni. <verse eid="LEV 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9"/>N fanma nɛn ɛ ra. N yi dii wuyaxi fi ɛ ma, ɛ wuya ayi. N na n ma layirin nakamalima nɛn en tagi. <verse eid="LEV 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10"/>Ɛ yala malo ramaraxine donma nɛn han malo xaba waxatin mɔn yi a li, ɛ yi a fonna dɔnxɛn woli ayi alogo a nɛnɛn xa ramara. <verse eid="LEV 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11"/>N luma nɛn ɛ yɛ, n mi n mɛ ɛ ra mumɛ! <verse eid="LEV 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12"/>N na n masiga tima nɛn ɛ tagi, n findi ɛ Ala ra. Ɛ yi findi n ma yamaan na. <verse eid="LEV 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13"/>Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala, naxan ɛ ramini Misiran bɔxɔni alogo ɛ xa ba Misiran kaane yii. N Misiran konyiyaan goronna ba nɛn ɛ ma, alogo ɛ xa nɔ sigan tiyɛ xunna kenli.”<verse eid="LEV 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Sariyane 28.15-68</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14"/>“Koni, xa ɛ mi n xuiin namɛ, ɛ yamarini itoe birin suxu, <verse eid="LEV 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15"/>xa ɛ n ma tɔnne kala, ɛ yi ɛ mɛ n ma sariyane ra, ɛ mi n ma yamarine birin liga, ɛ n ma layirin kala, <verse eid="LEV 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16"/>nayi, n ni ito nan ligama ɛ ra: N yihadin nagodoma nɛn ɛ ma, e nun fitina furene nun fati mawolonna, naxanye ɛ yɛɛne kalama, e yi ɛ niin ba. Ɛ sansine sima fuuni bayo ɛ yaxune nan e donma. <verse eid="LEV 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17"/>N kelima nɛn ɛ xili ma, alogo ɛ yaxune xa ɛ nɔ. Naxanye ɛ raɲaxuxi, ne yi nɔɔn sɔtɔ ɛ xun na. Ɛ ɛ giyɛ hali muxu yo mi ɛ fɔxɔ ra.”<verse eid="LEV 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18"/>“Na birin xanbi ra, xa ɛ mi n xuiin namɛ, n na ɛ yulubine saranma ɛ ra nɛn dɔxɔɲa ma solofere. <verse eid="LEV 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19"/>N yi ɛ wason kala, n yi kuyeni xara alo wurena, e nun bɔxɔna alo sulana. <verse eid="LEV 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20"/>Ɛ sɛnbɛn yi ɲan fuuni, bayo ɛ bɔxɔn mi bogi seene fiyɛ, yamanan wudine mi bogima.”<verse eid="LEV 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21"/>“Xa ɛ murutɛ n ma, ɛ tondi n xuiin namɛ, n na ɛ tɔrɔne rawuyama ayi nɛn dɔxɔ solofere naxan lanxi ɛ yulubine ma. <verse eid="LEV 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22"/>N burunna subene rafama nɛn ɛ xili ma naxanye ɛ diine faxama, e yi ɛ xuruseene raxɔri. E yi ɛ xurunɲɛ ayi han ɛ kirane yi yigeli.”<verse eid="LEV 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23"/>“Xa hali na birin ɛ mi xuru n ma, ɛ lu murutɛxi n ma, <verse eid="LEV 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24"/>n yɛtɛɛn kelima nɛn ɛ xili ma, n mɔn yi ɛ tɔrɔne rawuya ayi dɔxɔ solofere. <verse eid="LEV 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25"/>N yɛngɛn nakelima nɛn ɛ tan xili ma, n yi ɛ yulubine saran ɛ ra n ma layirin kala feen na. Ɛ na ɛ luxun ɛ taa ratangaxine yi, n fitina furen nafama nɛn, ɛ yi lu ɛ yaxune yiini. <verse eid="LEV 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26"/>N yi ɛ kuma donseen na, ɲaxalan fu yamaan birin ma burun ganma nɛn buru gande kedenni, e yi ɛ buruni taxun ligase xurudin na, ɛ yi a don koni ɛ mi lugo.”<verse eid="LEV 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27"/>“Xa hali na birin, ɛ mi n xuiin namɛ, ɛ yi lu murutɛxi n ma, <verse eid="LEV 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28"/>nayi, n kelima nɛn ɛ xili ma, n yi ɛ yulubine saran ɛ ra dɔxɔɲa ma solofere. <verse eid="LEV 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29"/>Ɛ ɛ diine suben donma nɛn. <verse eid="LEV 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30"/>N yi ɛ taan kidene kala, n yi ɛ wusulan gandene rabira. <verse eid="LEV 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31"/>N yi ɛ taane findi xɔrinxɔrinna ra, ɛ yire sariɲanxine yi raxɔri. Nayi, ɛ saraxane mi fa rafanma n ma. <verse eid="LEV 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32"/>N na ɛ yamanan kalama nɛn. Ɛ yaxune na fa dɔxɔdeni ɛ konne yi, e kabɛma nɛn a kalaxin ma. <verse eid="LEV 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33"/>N na ɛ raxuyama ayi nɛn yamanane yi, n yi bira ɛ fɔxɔ ra silanfanna ra, n yi ɛ sagatan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">26.33</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> Ɛ yamanani gelima nɛn, a yi findi taa xɔnne ra.”<verse eid="LEV 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34"/>“Nayi, ɛ nɛma ɛ yaxune yii e konni waxatin naxan yi, ɛ yamanani genla yi lu, ɛ bɔxɔn luma nɛn matabuni, matabu waxatine ɲɔxɔn na ɛ mi naxanye suxu. <verse eid="LEV 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35"/>A nɛma rabeɲinxi, a matabun sɔtɔma nɛn, ɛ mi tin naxanye ma ɛ yi dɔxi a yi waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="LEV 26:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36"/>Naxanye na lu e nii ra ɛ yɛ, n na e tunnaxɔlɔma e ma nɛn e yaxune yamanani, han e yi e gi ɲɔxɔnden gbansanna bira xuiin bun alo silanfanna, e bira hali muxe mi e fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="LEV 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37"/>E birama nɛn e bode fari alo e nɛma e giyɛ silanfanna bun, anu muxu yo mi e fɔxɔ ra. Ɛ mi nɔɛ tiyɛ ɛ yaxune yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="LEV 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38"/>Ɛ faxama nɛn siya gbɛtɛne tagi, ɛ yaxune yamanan yi ɛ don. <verse eid="LEV 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39"/>Naxanye na lu ɛ tan yɛ, ne doyenma nɛn han e faxa e yaxune yamanane yi e tan nun e benbane hakɛne fe ra.”<verse eid="LEV 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40"/>“Koni e na e ti e hakɛne ra e nun e benbane gbeene nun e tinxintareyaan nun e murutɛna, <verse eid="LEV 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41"/>feen naxanye a ligaxi, n yi keli e xili ma, n yi e rasiga e yaxune yamanani, nayi e Ala kolontare bɔɲɛne na xuru, e yi e hakɛne yanginna fi, <verse eid="LEV 26:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42"/>n na n mirima nɛn layirina feen ma nxu nun Yaxuba tagi, e nun nxu nun Isiyaga, e nun nxu nun Iburahima, n yi n miri yamanana fe ma. <verse eid="LEV 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43"/>Koni, fɔ yamanan nabeɲinxin xa lu singe, a yi a matabu e mi na waxatin naxan yi. E e hakɛne yanginna fima nɛn amasɔtɔ e bata e mɛ n ma sariyane nun tɔnne ra. <verse eid="LEV 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44"/>Koni, hali e lu e yaxune yamanani, n mi e rabeɲinɲɛ han e yi raxɔri, n yi n ma layirin kala. Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan n tan na, e Ala. <verse eid="LEV 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45"/>N na n mirima nɛn n ma layirin ma, naxan nxu nun e benbane tagi, n naxanye ramini Misiran bɔxɔni siyane yɛtagi, alogo n xa findi e Ala ra. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="LEV 26:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46"/>Alatala tɔnne nun yamarine nun sariyane nan ne ra, a naxanye falaxi Isirayila kaane xa fata Musa ra Sinayi geyaan fari.<verse eid="LEV 26:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27"/>
  <para style="s">Muxun naxanye fixi Ala ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="LEV 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Xa muxuna nde bata a dɛ ti, a muxuna nde fi Alatala ma, a xunbama gbetin nan na naxan lanxi a yatɛn ma. <verse eid="LEV 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3"/>Xa xɛmɛn na a ra naxan barin bata ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛ ti han ɲɛɛ tonge sennin, i xa a saren yatɛ gbeti gbanan tonge suulun na, gbeti gbananna naxanye rawalima yire sariɲanxini. <verse eid="LEV 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4"/>Xa ɲaxanla na a ra, gbeti gbanan tonge saxan. <verse eid="LEV 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5"/>Dii xɛmɛn naxan barin bata ɲɛɛ suulun ti han ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛ, na lanma gbeti gbanan mɔxɔɲɛ nan ma. Dii tɛmɛna, gbeti gbanan fu. <verse eid="LEV 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6"/>Dii xɛmɛn naxan barin bata kike kedenna ti han ɲɛɛ suulun, na lanma gbeti gbanan suulun nan ma. Dii tɛmɛna, gbeti gbanan saxan. <verse eid="LEV 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7"/>Xɛmɛn naxan bata dangu ɲɛɛ tonge senninna ra, na lanma gbeti gbanan fu nun suulun ma. Ɲaxanla, gbeti gbanan fu. <verse eid="LEV 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8"/>Naxan bata a dɛ ti, xa yiigelitɔɔn na a ra, a mi nɔɛ na gbetin yatɛn fiyɛ, a lan a yi na muxun xali saraxaraliin fɛma. Na nɔɛ gbetin xasabina nde falɛ nɛn a nɔɛ naxan fiyɛ.”<verse eid="LEV 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9"/>“Xa muxuna nde bata a dɛ ti xurusena fe ra naxan nɔɛ bɛ saraxan na Alatala xa, na xuruse sifan na fi Alatala ma, a bata rasariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10"/>A mi masarɛ gbɛtɛ ra. A faɲin mi masarɛ a kobin na, a kobin mi masarɛ a faɲin na. Xa a kanna xuruseen masara gbɛtɛ ra, e firinna birin bata rasariɲan. <verse eid="LEV 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11"/>Xa suben na a ra naxan haramuxi, naxan mi bɛ saraxan na Alatala xa, a xa xali saraxaraliin fɛma. <verse eid="LEV 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12"/>Saraxaraliin xa a saren fala, xa suben fan, hanma a mi fan. A na saren naxan fala, a bata lu na ma. <verse eid="LEV 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13"/>Xa a kanna waxi suben xunba feni, a xa a ɲɔxɔn fi a yi yaganna dɔxɔɲa ma firin sa a fari.”<verse eid="LEV 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14"/>“Xa muxuna nde a banxin fi Alatala ma, saraxaraliin xa a saren fala, xa a fan hanma a mi fan. A na naxan fala, a bata lu na ma. <verse eid="LEV 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15"/>Xa a kanna waxi a xunba feni, a xa a ɲɔxɔn fi a yi yaganna dɔxɔɲa ma firin sa a fari. Banxin yi xɛtɛ a kanna ma.”<verse eid="LEV 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16"/>“Xa muxuna nde a xɛɛn fi Alatala ma, a saren xa fala fata sansiin yatɛn na naxan xuyɛ a ma. Malo bɛnbɛli gbee saxan xuyɛ bɔxɔn naxan ma, na lanma gbeti gbanan tonge suulun nan ma. <verse eid="LEV 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17"/>Xa xɛɛn fixi Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛn nin, a saren luma na kii nin. <verse eid="LEV 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18"/>Xa xɛɛn fixi Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛn xanbin nin, saraxaraliin xa ɲɛɛne yatɛ naxan luxi benun Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛ famatɔna, a yi nde ba xɛɛn saren na. <verse eid="LEV 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19"/>Xa xɛɛ kanna waxi a xunba feni, a xa a ɲɔxɔn fi, a yi yaganna dɔxɔɲa ma firin sa a fari, xɛɛn yi xɛtɛ a kanna ma. <verse eid="LEV 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20"/>Xa a mi xɛɛn xunba, a yi a mati muxu gbɛtɛ ma, a mi fa nɔɛ a xunbɛ. <verse eid="LEV 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21"/>Xɛɛn na yɛba Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛni, a bata rasariɲan, a so Alatala yii kiseen na habadan! A findima saraxaraline gbeen nan na. <verse eid="LEV 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22"/>Xa muxuna nde xɛɛn fi Alatala ma a naxan saraxi, naxan mi yi a kɛɛni, <verse eid="LEV 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23"/>saraxaraliin xa a saren fala fata ɲɛɛne yatɛn na naxanye luxi benun Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛna. Na kanna xa a saren fi na lɔxɔ yɛtɛni. A sariɲan Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24"/>Xɛɛn naxɛtɛma a kari singen ma nɛn Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛni, a sara naxan ma, naxan gbee yi a ra nun. <verse eid="LEV 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25"/>Na sarene birin falama nɛn fata yire sariɲanxin gbeti gbananna ra, naxan lanxi garamu fu ma.”<verse eid="LEV 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26"/>“Muxu yo nama a xuruse dii singen fi Alatala ma na kiini, amasɔtɔ Alatala nan gbee dii singene birin na hali ba na feen na. Ɲinge ba, yɛxɛɛ ba, Alatala nan gbee e birin na. <verse eid="LEV 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27"/>Xa a findi sube haramuxin dii singen na, a kanna nɔɛ a xunbɛ nɛn. A xa a ɲɔxɔn fi, a yi yaganna dɔxɔɲa ma firin sa a fari. Xa a mi a xunba, a xa a mati a sare falaxin na.”<verse eid="LEV 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28"/>“Koni, muxun na sese fi Alatala ma habadanni, muxu ba, xuruse ba, a kɛɛ xɛɛn ba, na sese mi sarɛ, a mi xunbɛ. Naxan yo na fi a ma habadanni, na bata sariɲan a xa fefe. <verse eid="LEV 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29"/>Hali a findi muxun na naxan fixi Ala ma habadanni, a mi nɔɛ xunbɛ, ɛ xa a faxa.”<verse eid="LEV 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30"/>“Alatala nan gbee bɔxɔn bogiseene birin yaganna ra. A na keli xɛɛn ma hanma langan kui, a sariɲan Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="LEV 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31"/>Xa muxuna nde waxi a yaganna yirena nde xunba feni, fɔ a xa a ɲɔxɔn fi, a yi na yiren yaganna dɔxɔɲa ma firin sa a fari. <verse eid="LEV 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32"/>Alatala nan gbee xuruseene birin yaganna ra, a xurin nun a xungbena. Xuruseene na yatɛ, Alatala nan gbee e fudene ra. <verse eid="LEV 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33"/>Xuruseene mi yɛbama a faɲin nun a kobin na. Xuruseen nama masara gbɛtɛ ra. Xa a na liga e firinna birin nasariɲanma nɛn, e mi nɔɛ xunbɛ.”<verse eid="LEV 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34"/>Alatala na yamarine nan so Musa yii Isirayila kaane xa Sinayi geyaan fari.<verse eid="LEV 27:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27"/>
</usx>
